26-07-18T23:58:37Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:58:37Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"fix(scraper): retry Cinepolis scrape session on transient failure\n\nProd logs showed the unattended 06:00 cron scrape failing (403/empty\nresult) three days straight while manual triggers minutes later succeeded\ncleanly every time — a session-level Cloudflare hiccup, not a structural\nbreak. Wraps the browser session in up to 3 attempts with a 30s backoff;\nretries on both raised errors and an empty movie list (Cloudflare can\nreturn 200 with nothing useful). The happy path is unaffected — succeeds\non attempt 1 same as before, no extra logging noise.","tree":{"sha":"6b8372855949c577c2136f0149b5bb86f9abf6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/6b8372855949c577c2136f0149b5bb86f9abf6f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/c5b7b479ab9558f6ce4e778f2410195d2f9f83a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAra