l.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"debug: expose ScrapeLog.errors in the admin scrape-logs endpoint\n\nNeeded to diagnose why Cinepolis scraping is failing in prod without\nshell access to the container — the errors column already existed on\nthe model, just wasn''t serialized in ScrapeLogOut.","tree":{"sha":"75b946441099b369ebc24d0a9766240cd9fa48f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/75b946441099b369ebc24d0a9766240cd9fa48f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/8c893a317379d9fc9dd0700c43554b45608dce94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/8c893a317379d9fc9dd0700c43554b45608dce94","node_id":"C_kwDOTa76JtoAKDhjODkzYTMxNzM3OWQ5ZmM5ZGQwNzAwYzQzNTU0YjQ1NjA4ZGNlOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176","sha":"d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176"}],"sha":"8c893a317379d9fc9dd0700c43554b45608dce94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/8c893a317379d9fc9dd0700c43554b45608dce94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:57:43Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:57:43Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"docs: add RUNBOOK, update README, prep VPS deploy with Traefik\n\n- docs/RUNBOOK.md: what to do when today''s listings are missing, Cinepolis\n  returns 401/403, Normandie''s HTML changes, or OMDb fails/returns stale N/A\n  ratings.\n- Logging: 401/403 from Cinepolis GraphQL now log an actionable message\n  pointing at the runbook (stale x-apikey vs Cloudflare block); orchestrator\n  logs a per-run \"IMDb ratings: X/Y matched\" summary (WARNING if 0 matched)\n  to make silent OMDb degradation (quota, key issues) visible in logs.\n- README: renamed to Butaca, documents actual architecture (Cinepolis via\n  Playwright+GraphQL, Normandie via BS4, optional OMDb), removed stale\n  SCRAPE_CITY/CINEPOLIS_BASE_URL references.\n- docker-compose.vps.yml + .env.deploy.example: generic Traefik-based\n  production compose for self-hosting on a VPS, decoupled from the\n  homelab-specific docker-compose.prod.yml. Deploy vars (domains, ACME\n  email) live in .env.deploy instead of .env so they don''t leak into the\n  api container''s environment and trip pydantic-settings'' extra_forbidden.\n- CSS: wider trailer modal on desktop (720px) — mitigates YouTube defaulting\n  to 360p in a small embed.\n- features.md / CURRENT.md: tracked pending items (TMDb fallback, GitHub\n  mirror, VPS domains) so they don''t get lost.","tree":{"sha":"5d1dfb8cdd6be2e20dce495ec3f0262385e7df61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/5d1dfb8cdd6be2e20dce495ec3f0262385e7df61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176","node_id":"C_kwDOTa76JtoAKGQyMzBhYWRhZWY5NzI0ZTQ5MzliYTUxM2ZjNTEwYjk4YzFlZGQxNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292","sha":"5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292"}],"sha":"d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d230aadaef9724e4939ba513fc510b98c1edd176"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T22:49:46Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T22:49:46Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"fix(scraper): handle Normandie''s new same-month week header format\n\nNormandie changed \"jueves 28 de mayo al miércoles 3 de junio\" (both months\nexplicit) to \"jueves 16 al miércoles 22 de julio\" (month only trails the end\nday). The old regex grabbed the first \"day de month\" match as the week''s\nstart anchor, which under the new format was actually the end day — every\nother day in the week fell outside the computed date map and got silently\ndropped, so only the last day of the week ever showed showtimes.\n\nNow anchors on the end day (always has an explicit month) and derives the\nstart date from it, handling both the same-month and cross-month cases.","tree":{"sha":"bf267a6a82f68b94a459c41dcd1cc140da55736c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/bf267a6a82f68b94a459c41dcd1cc140da55736c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292","node_id":"C_kwDOTa76JtoAKDUwMzJhYjE0ZDEyYjAxYWM2ZGNmNGRlMjhlZTcwZmRlZjkxODAyOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984","sha":"d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984"}],"sha":"5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/5032ab14d12b01ac6dcf4de28ee70fdef9180292"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T22:08:21Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T22:08:21Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"fix(scraper): fall back to original_title for OMDb lookups\n\nLocalized Spanish titles from Cinepolis often don''t match OMDb''s English\nentries (e.g. \"Evil Dead: En Llamas\" vs \"Evil Dead Burn\"), so retry with\noriginal_title when the localized title''s lookup misses or has no rating.","tree":{"sha":"4e3ebfac4ae9314891f69647de98816dbe267379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/4e3ebfac4ae9314891f69647de98816dbe267379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984","node_id":"C_kwDOTa76JtoAKGQzOGMwNjc5NjJhMzkyMzYxZjM4ZTFiZDA4ZWU2YzNhNDU4OWM5ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commit/82f0a812bb953b9211f38ffede01e1e6f1fcf5b9","sha":"82f0a812bb953b9211f38ffede01e1e6f1fcf5b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/82f0a812bb953b9211f38ffede01e1e6f1fcf5b9"}],"sha":"d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/d38c067962a392361f38e1bd08ee6c3a4589c984"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/commits/82f0a812bb953b9211f38ffede01e1e6f1fcf5b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:46:05Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:46:05Z","email":"arayaromero@gmail.com","name":"Arayama"},"message":"feat(scraper): rewrite Cinepolis scraper for cinepolis.com/cl via Playwright\n\nCinepolis migrated from cinepolischile.cl (plain ASP.NET JSON API) to a new\nNext.js micro-frontend platform (cinepolis.com/cl). The billboard data now\nlives behind a GraphQL API (api-g.cinepolis.com) protected by Cloudflare bot\nmanagement — plain httpx gets a 403 challenge regardless of headers, so a\nreal headless browser is required to pass the challenge before calling the\nAPI.\n\nNew src/scraper/cinepolis.py drives Chromium via Playwright, then issues the\nGraphQL queries with fetch() inside the page (reusing its cleared session).\nThe new API already returns synopsis/genre/rating/poster inline, so this\nreplaces the old two-phase pipeline (listing API + detail-page scrape) with\na single phase per cinema — api_client.py and detail.py are now dead and\nremoved.\n\nAlso drops scrape_city/cinepolis_base_url from config (unused now — the\ncinema list is hardcoded per the two cinemas the frontend actually shows),\nand adds the chromium install step to the Dockerfile.","tree":{"sha":"f5d704ebee6eef9379c87fc14e738b7405bc9291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/trees/f5d704ebee6eef9379c87fc14e738b7405bc9291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarioAraya/butaca-app/git/commits/82f0a812bb953b9211f38ffede01e1e6f1fcf5b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1564554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioAraya","id":1564554,"login":"MarioAraya","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ1NTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioAraya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://