 bcprov-jdk18on 1.85 -> 1.85.2 (#159).\n\nCI workflow: bump actions/upload-artifact v4->v7 (#162),\nactions/download-artifact v4->v8 (#165), aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials\nv4->v6 (#160), appleboy/ssh-action v1.2.0->v1.2.5 (#161), appleboy/scp-action\nv0.1.7->v1.0.0 (#158).\n\nFrontend: bump @angular/forms and @angular/platform-browser (#167, #164),\n@angular/cli (#168), postcss (#166), and typescript-eslint (#163). Angular''s\nframework packages are tightly peer-coupled, so common/compiler/core/router/\ncompiler-cli were bumped alongside forms/platform-browser to the same\nconsistent version (22.1.2, one patch ahead of what Dependabot individually\ntargeted) rather than leaving them at mismatched versions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d41637570af81770c9672db0621a8d0694dd8856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/trees/d41637570af81770c9672db0621a8d0694dd8856"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/commits/c3d910e2837d0042058ebae738ed88d72d5a4ecb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53492872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Efren707","id":53492872,"login":"Efren707","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDkyODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/E