fren707","id":53492872,"login":"Efren707","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDkyODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/commits/f87ce4d415ad6c2a1ba6fe650e61f92ea2daf214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T03:46:54Z","email":"53492872+Efren707@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Efren707"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T03:46:54Z","email":"53492872+Efren707@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Efren707"},"message":"feat: add demo-login endpoint, CSRF/rate-limit wiring, and ADR 0045\n\nCompletes section 1 of the demo account milestone: DemoLoginService\nlooks up the (not-yet-seeded) demo user and establishes a session via\nSessionEstablisher, with no password and no interaction with\nLoginService''s lockout tracking. Wires POST /auth/demo-login into\nSecurityConfig''s CSRF exemption/permitAll and a new\nRateLimitGroup.DEMO_LOGIN (IP-keyed, 5/hour, matching REGISTER''s\nshape), adds UserSummary.isDemo for the frontend, and covers it all\nwith AuthControllerDemoLoginTest. ADR 0045 records the design.","tree":{"sha":"e6acdf4f949e2986310574add00def2a33b333b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/trees/e6acdf4f949e2986310574add00def2a33b333b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/commits/f87ce4d415ad6c2a1ba6fe650e61f92ea2daf214","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53492872?v=4","events_url":"https://