","name":"Efren707"},"message":"docs: record smoke test results and the CSRF cross-subdomain cookie bugs\n\nSmoke test surfaced a cross-subdomain CSRF cookie bug (403 on logout/\nbuy, PR #131) and a follow-on RFC 6265 cookie-domain-format bug that\nbriefly took the live app down (PR #132). Both fixed and verified live;\nfull checklist (register/login/logout/quote/buy/sell/portfolio/\ntransactions/performance) now passes against app.toptrader.dev. Also\nchecks off the checkSession() blank-page item, resolved as a side\neffect of the same testing.","tree":{"sha":"15b65563959fd57ba2df8d5ad1c19be3391da6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/trees/15b65563959fd57ba2df8d5ad1c19be3391da6f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Efren707/toptrader/git/commits/250dceb18c8952951f2eea50dd5c45db491ada91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53492872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Efren707","id":53492872,"login":"Efren707","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDkyODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efren707","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Efren707/toptrader/commit/250dceb18c8952951f2eea50dd5c45db491ada91","node_id":"C_kwDOTa_LG