ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/a1e2dd58613d44319aeb9d9bc80705a636df2a93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T22:52:20Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T22:52:20Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"fix(beta): port 5173 mapping is dead + grep recipe wrong\n\nCold-walk on a fresh Hetzner VM exposed two README-following failures:\n\n1. docker-compose.yml mapped \"5173:5173\" but nothing listens on 5173 in\n   the bundle. The Hono server serves both API and the built React SPA\n   at port 3000 (server/src/bootstrap/app.ts:170 `serveStatic({root:\n   ''./public''})`). Users opening http://localhost:5173 got Connection\n   Refused.\n   Fix: drop the 5173 port mapping; inline comment explains why.\n\n2. README + docs/beta/getting-started.md said\n   `docker compose logs bonobo-app | grep -A1 \"AUTH TOKEN\"`. The\n   entrypoint banner is \"Generated new auth token (server/.auth-token):\"\n   — no \"AUTH TOKEN\" substring. Users got empty grep output.\n   Fix: grep for \"auth token\" (case-sensitive, matches the banner).\n\n3. Updated \"open http://localhost:5173\" → \"open http://localhost:3000\"\n   throughout README + getting-started, and the bundle-services table\n   description.\n\nVerified on fresh Hetzner cpx21 (Ashburn): docker compose up -d → 30s\nto healthy → external HTTP probe returns the React app + /api/capabilities\nreturns 200. Friends following the README now actually reach the UI.","tree":{"sha":"a29646092571719134cc06b53e19b8a632f594c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/a29646092571719134cc06b53e19b8a632f594c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/a1e2dd58613d44319aeb9d9bc80705a636df2a93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/a1e2dd58613d44319aeb9d9bc80705a636df2a93","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGExZTJkZDU4NjEzZDQ0MzE5YWViOWQ5YmM4MDcwNWE2MzZkZjJhOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commi