pi.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/439cec7188bf04c10293bf24a8508a08e27531c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:58:44Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:58:44Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): switch base to debian-slim (fixes bun-pty glibc/musl)\n\nbun-pty (used by the in-chat terminal feature) ships only a glibc-linked\nlibrust_pty.so. Alpine''s musl can''t load it; the previous image silently\ndisabled the chat-terminal panel.\n\nChanges:\n- ARG BUN_VERSION=1.3-alpine -> 1.3-slim\n- apk add -> apt-get install for bubblewrap + ca-certificates + git + curl\n  (added ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive)\n- su-exec -> gosu (Debian equivalent)\n- adduser/addgroup -> useradd/groupadd\n\nImage size impact: ~+196 MB content (Alpine: 189 MB / Debian-slim: 385 MB\ncontent per docker image ls). Acceptable trade for working terminal in-bundle.\n\nVerified: bun-pty module loads, spawns a real PTY, exchanges bytes, and\nexits cleanly inside the new image (probe in /tmp/pty-probe.mjs).","tree":{"sha":"c3c19d1c911f6a0c73b521e0714a643b692e0ca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/c3c19d1c911f6a0c73b521e0714a643b692e0ca2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/439cec7188bf04c10293bf24a8508a08e27531c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"lo