026-05-16T16:20:00Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:20:00Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): root .env.example for bundle context\n\nBundle-context .env separate from server/.env.example (which retains\nits LAN-specific dev defaults like melmbox URLs, ik_llama paths, etc.).\n\nSections:\n- Required: HF_TOKEN + at least one of SYNTHETIC/ANTHROPIC/DEEPINFRA/\n  MINIMAX provider keys (or OLLAMA_HOST_BRIDGE=1 for local-only chat)\n- Bundle services: MEILI_MASTER_KEY (placeholder, please change)\n- Optional: OLLAMA_HOST_BRIDGE, ANTHROPIC_DISABLE_CACHING,\n  BONOBO_MAX_ROUNDS_CEILING, SANDBOX_BACKEND\n\nThe docker-compose.yml `env_file: - .env` reads this at the repo root\non `docker compose up`.","tree":{"sha":"e07c18cc959f643d3092ae26bfbd21ae98c1171a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/e07c18cc959f643d3092ae26bfbd21ae98c1171a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/45cc390cdd474d66570613bb9bf0052fbf61f9ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/45cc390cdd474d66570613bb9bf0052fbf61f9ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDQ1Y2MzOTBjZGQ0NzRkNjY1NzA2MTNiYjliZjAwNTJmYmY2MWY5ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca","sha":"4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca"}],"sha":"45cc390cdd474d66570613bb9bf0052fbf61f9ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/45cc390cdd474d66570613bb9bf0052fbf61f9ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:18:36Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:18:36Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"fix(docker): server-writable /app tree + correct .auth-token path\n\n- Dockerfile: broaden chown to the whole /app tree so the bonobo user\n  (uid 10001) can write .auth-token, conversations.db, downloads.json,\n  etc. Single-user container; security boundary is the container.\n  Also add a missing COPY for shared/node_modules so workspace deps\n  are present at runtime.\n- Entrypoint: write .auth-token to /app/server/.auth-token (where\n  auth.ts expects via join(import.meta.dir, \"../../.auth-token\")),\n  not the data/ subdir. Chown it to bonobo after creation since\n  the entrypoint runs as root.\n- Entrypoint: pre-create /home/bonobo/.bonobo (diagnostics SQLite)\n  and /home/bonobo/.bonobo-terminal (USER_DATA_DIR) so the server''s\n  bun:sqlite stores can open without manual mkdir.\n- Banner text now correctly says server/.auth-token.\n\nVerified: docker run --rm bonobo-app:dev now boots the server cleanly\n(no EACCES, server stays up until SIGTERM); Capabilities subsystem\nreports hosts=4, bindings=3.","tree":{"sha":"6a7344bf24cba6301141c41bc720ad7acb12231d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/6a7344bf24cba6301141c41bc720ad7acb12231d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDRhMTUxMTQzMzQ4ZDAwZDkzMDVmNmQ3Y2RiMDkxYjYwMDQ0NGIzY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291","sha":"f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291"}],"sha":"4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/4a151143348d00d9305f6d7cdb091b600444b3ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:08:48Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:08:48Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): compose with bonobo-app + qdrant + meili + crawl4ai\n\n4-service bundle for the private beta:\n- bonobo-app  : the UI + API (Bun + Hono backend, React 19 frontend)\n- qdrant 1.12.4    : vector store for semantic memory\n- meili 1.11       : keyword search + conversation index\n- crawl4ai 0.8.6   : web scraping backend for the web_scrape tool\n\nAll deps gated by healthchecks; bonobo-app waits via depends_on +\ncondition: service_healthy. Volumes for data, conversations, qdrant,\nmeili. Optional HF cache mount from $HOME/.cache/huggingface to reuse\nhost-side model downloads.\n\nextra_hosts: host.docker.internal:host-gateway lets bonobo-app discover\na host-side Ollama when OLLAMA_HOST_BRIDGE=1 in .env.\n\nUses build: . for now; T-distribution swaps to image: from raidbox\nGitea registry once published.\n\nDeviations from the template:\n- crawl4ai tag pinned to 0.8.6 (latest stable as of 2026-03-25);\n  the template''s 0.5.0 does not exist on Docker Hub. Available\n  tag series jumps 0.7.x -> 0.8.x.\n- qdrant healthcheck uses bash /dev/tcp instead of wget. The\n  qdrant/qdrant:v1.12.4 image ships no wget / curl / nc, but does\n  include bash, so we open a TCP socket to localhost:6333 and grep\n  for \"200 OK\" off /readyz.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1d4ea49669b57774ed6745e77266f7847a3e84b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/f1d4ea49669b57774ed6745e77266f7847a3e84b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGY0YjliNzBkOGZmMWE5NjMyZTQyYjU0NmE1ZDA5NjkyOTgyYTEyOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab","sha":"6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab"}],"sha":"f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/f4b9b70d8ff1a9632e42b546a5d09692982a1291"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:02:38Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T16:02:38Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): idempotent entrypoint — seed auth token + hosts + bindings + sandbox probe\n\nReplaces the T16 stub. On every container boot:\n1. Generate .auth-token (32 chars) if missing; log it to stdout once\n2. Seed hosts.json with host_local + qdrant + meilisearch + crawl4ai\n   (or +ollama_host when OLLAMA_HOST_BRIDGE=1)\n3. Seed capability-bindings.json with vector-store/search-index/\n   web-fetch pre-bound (+ embed/summarize when bridged Ollama)\n4. Probe bwrap; write sandbox-status.json so Diagnostics can show\n   whether tool execution is sandboxed or unconfined\n5. chown the data volume to bonobo:bonobo (in case of fresh volume)\n6. exec su-exec bonobo \"\\$@\" to drop root\n\nAll steps idempotent: existing files are never overwritten.","tree":{"sha":"051a5e3261423f56707aa1202615a63ea3824559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/051a5e3261423f56707aa1202615a63ea3824559"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDZkNzNiNzllZmFkZjc3NGRhYjI2M2UxNzc5NjkxZDI1NzY3YWVhYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d","sha":"07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d"}],"sha":"6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/6d73b79efadf774dab263e1779691d25767aeaab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:48:47Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:48:47Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): multi-stage Bun+Alpine image\n\n3 stages:\n1. deps  - install workspace deps from lockfile\n2. build - Vite production build of frontend (src/dist)\n3. runtime - Alpine + bwrap + bun, non-root user (bonobo:10001),\n   entrypoint script handles idempotent boot init (T17)\n\nIncludes a stub docker-entrypoint.sh (just `exec \"$@\"`); T17\nreplaces with real auth-token/hosts.json/binding seeding.\n\nNon-trivial workarounds vs the task template:\n- deps stage also copies .npmrc so bun install can authenticate\n  to the private Verdaccio registry (@bonobo:registry) and pull\n  @bonobo/ui; without it bun install fails with 401 Unauthorized.\n- build stage also copies tsconfig.base.json from the repo root;\n  src/tsconfig.json extends \"../tsconfig.base.json\" and tsc -b\n  (part of the `build` script) errors with iteration/module\n  target diagnostics if the base config isn''t present.\n\nImage: 189MB content / 1.09GB disk; build time ~36s on cache miss.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6823dfc2abf2a39f86b60b173fc17ee3f5116c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/c6823dfc2abf2a39f86b60b173fc17ee3f5116c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDA3Zjc5MmE3Y2JkNjk4N2UzNWU4ZmQ0NjAzODg3ZmU5ZDk5YjExNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d","sha":"5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d"}],"sha":"07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/07f792a7cbd6987e35e8fd4603887fe9d99b116d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:42:56Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:42:56Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"build(docker): expand .dockerignore for beta bundle\n\nWas a 9-line minimum. Now explicitly excludes:\n- workspace-wide node_modules + build outputs (.next, .vite, dist)\n- secrets + per-user runtime state (hosts.json, .auth-token, .env)\n- runtime data (conversations.db, downloads/, screenshots/, etc.)\n- test artifacts + benchmarks\n- docs (the bundled image doesn''t ship docs)\n\nKeeps the bonobo-app image small and prevents leaking operator state\ninto a published image.","tree":{"sha":"7d3447f6bb8459ee5c397b584f96cbfd1e65d306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/7d3447f6bb8459ee5c397b584f96cbfd1e65d306"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/5841ba994f4badb5804bdabdf71f0830b4e03f3d","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDU4NDFiYTk5NGY0YmFkYjU4MDRiZGFiZGY3MWYwODMwYjRlMDNmM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://git