hip + chatInstallRunsStore: receives install_progress\n  events and renders an inline progress chip on the assistant turn\n- streamCallbacks: install_progress dispatch + installNav unit test\n- ToolCallInline / ChatMessage: surface ChatInstallChip in the\n  expected place\n- uiStore: tab-nav coordination so the chip can deep-link to\n  Models > Installed\n- ModelsPage: highlight the row matching a deep-link from chat","tree":{"sha":"793fd414710840804c9cdc4cc9d938e74790f1b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/793fd414710840804c9cdc4cc9d938e74790f1b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/aed6da94ae6e141cacbb5adf411d7fd2be0cfe25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/aed6da94ae6e141cacbb5adf411d7fd2be0cfe25","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGFlZDZkYTk0YWU2ZTE0MWNhY2JiNWFkZjQxMWQ3ZmQyYmUwY2