lityIcons.ts CAP_ICON_BY_KEY map.\n\nSurfaces in:\n  - GET /api/capabilities/registry (new payload fields)\n  - Onboarding BindStep (icon + description per row)\n  - Settings CapabilityRow + HostCard\n  - DiscoverStep (icon per detected service)\n\nFrontend consumes via the new useCapabilityRegistry hook in\nsrc/hooks/onboarding/. Provider-side meta-extension landed in T1\n(commit f52a954 / 8ac6143 after amend); this commit completes the\nend-to-end wiring.","tree":{"sha":"2adf2e716e076eeb67f069b0c1d6259daa253ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/2adf2e716e076eeb67f069b0c1d6259daa253ee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/58a9c2acc040157344db1e7738a289b14208c4e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/58a9c2acc040157344db1e7738a289b14208c4e2","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDU4YTljM