,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/933d1ef4e8fa5aaa04cd4d0c58602ce5900955a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T09:29:31Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T09:29:31Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"docs(launch): private-beta readiness design (lightweight compose bundle)\n\nFive-track plan: stabilize WIP (types + 74 failing tests), verify capabilities\ndegraded path, multi-stage Dockerfile + 4-service compose (bonobo-app + Qdrant\n+ Meilisearch + Crawl4AI), beta docs, fresh-VM smoke test. Ollama deferred to\nhost install. Target launch ~2026-05-23.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a443b5e3d986b1089ea07e56cb1375312e97b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/3a443b5e3d986b1089ea07e56cb1375312e97b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/933d1ef4e8fa5aaa04cd4d0c58602ce5900955a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/933d1ef4e8fa5aaa04cd4d0c58602ce5900955a2","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDkzM2QxZWY0ZThmYTVhYWEwNGNkNGQwYzU4NjAyY2U1OTAwOTU1YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0","sha":"37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0"}],"sha":"933d1ef4e8fa5aaa04cd4d0c58602ce5900955a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/933d1ef4e8fa5aaa04cd4d0c58602ce5900955a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T06:03:45Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T06:03:45Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"feat(projectRunner): OOM detection, exit-127 install chip, sandbox/ENOENT 503, coverage gaps\n\nCloses review items #11 (continuation), #12, #13 and the remaining\ncoverage gaps from docs/superpowers/reviews/2026-05-13-project-dev-server-review.md.\n138 backend tests pass across the runner subsystem.\n\nOOM detection (#12)\n- New services/projectRunner/cgroupOomMonitor.ts: resolves the runner''s cgroup\n  v2 memory.events path from /proc/<setsidPid>/cgroup, polls every 1s for an\n  oom_kill increment, fires onOom() when it climbs. Graceful no-op when the\n  cgroup path isn''t resolvable (cgroup v1 host, no systemd-run wrap, scope\n  dir not yet written, etc.) — never throws.\n- runnerSpawner wires the monitor after the PGID sentinel resolves so the\n  cgroup path uses the real session-leader PID. On OOM, calls\n  registry.markCrashed(rid, \"OOM kill\", 137). Disposed in child.exited cleanup.\n\nExit-127 install-suggestion chip (#13)\n- New services/projectRunner/exitCodeScanner.ts: subscribes to a runner''s log\n  buffer, scans each line against framework-keyed regex patterns for missing\n  dependencies (MODULE_NOT_FOUND / ModuleNotFoundError / command-not-found),\n  emits Suggestion {kind:\"install-dep\", framework, command, hint, ts} with a\n  5-second dedupe window.\n- RunnerHandle gains suggestions: Suggestion[] and suggestionEvents EventEmitter.\n- /logs SSE endpoint replays suggestions[] on subscribe and forwards live\n  emissions as event:suggestion frames.\n- RunnerLogView.tsx parses event:suggestion, renders a dismissible chip above\n  the log box with IconAlertCircle + \"Copy command\" button. Click-to-install\n  is out of scope (needs a separate run-in-cwd endpoint).\n\nSandbox/ENOENT translation (#15 follow-on)\n- New SandboxUnavailableError thrown by startRunner when bwrap isn''t on PATH.\n- routes/projects/projectRunnerRoutes.ts catch maps it to HTTP 503 with\n  {error, code:\"SANDBOX_UNAVAILABLE\"}.\n\nsystemd-run user-bus env regression\n- buildChildEnv strips DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS and XDG_RUNTIME_DIR; without\n  them systemd-run --user can''t reach the user bus and the spawn fails\n  immediately. runnerSpawner now re-injects both when withSystemdRun=true.\n  This fix restores the integration tests on hosts with linger enabled.\n\nCoverage closure\n- New projectRunnerCapacity.test.ts: 429 returned when registry cap exceeded.\n- New projectRunnerLogsAbort.test.ts: /logs SSE unsubscribes on req.signal abort.\n- previewProxyWs.test.ts: inner-close-after-open and inner-error-after-open\n  propagate via onUpstreamClose.\n- detectRunConfig.test.ts: scripts.dev no-lockfile → npm run dev,\n  scripts.start no-dev → npm start, scripts.start with bun.lock → bun run start.\n- runnerSpawner.live.ts: SIGTERM trap test confirming signal reaches the\n  bwrap-namespaced child via the PGID kill.\n- runnerSpawner.test.ts: bwrap availability gate tests for cached + injected probe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9964b0c2a35c621e913c9afa7a40770e9ba9fd20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/9964b0c2a35c621e913c9afa7a40770e9ba9fd20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDM3YjQ3Y2JjYmIyZWMwNzA0ZDI2MWY2MWExODhjYzM4ZWM2ODc5YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77","sha":"8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77"}],"sha":"37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/37b47cbcbb2ec0704d261f61a188cc38ec6879a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T05:09:32Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T05:09:32Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"fix(projectRunner): carry-over issues from 2026-05-13 review wrap-up\n\nThree small follow-ups to commit 2c4e0e0.\n\nrunnersStore reload race\n- setAllForProject now merges instead of wiping: any locally-known runner in\n  \"starting\" state that isn''t yet in the server snapshot is preserved. This\n  closes the race where a startRunner upsert is wiped by a concurrent GET\n  /runners that fired before the server registered the new runner.\n- Regression tests added: race-preservation case + eviction-of-terminal case\n  to make sure the merge still drops stale exited/crashed runners.\n\nRunnerLogView status narrowing\n- Pre-existing TS error at RunnerLogView.tsx:69: SSE status payload typed as\n  string but setStatus expects RunnerStatus. Added an isRunnerStatus type\n  guard against [\"starting\",\"running\",\"exited\",\"crashed\"] before the store\n  call. Malformed payloads now silently skip instead of poisoning the store.\n\nprofiles router wildcard scoping\n- profilesRoutes.use(\"*\", authMiddleware()) leaked onto every sibling route\n  mounted under the same app.route(\"/api\", ...) prefix that registered after\n  it, forcing a fragile mount-order workaround in bootstrap/app.ts.\n- Scoped to use(\"/profiles\", ...) + use(\"/profiles/*\", ...) so the auth and\n  id-validation middlewares only fire on /profiles paths. The mount-order\n  comment in app.ts is now informational rather than load-bearing.\n\n109 backend tests + 5 frontend store tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64bced25d9d2148d178924f48b5462fa903a8312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/64bced25d9d2148d178924f48b5462fa903a8312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDhhZmQ2YTRiNmI0NTkyZWZiYWI2OTkzMWEzNWJjY2JlMGYzYjZiNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9","sha":"2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9"}],"sha":"8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/8afd6a4b6b4592efbab69931a35bccbe0f3b6b77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T04:57:36Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T04:57:36Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"feat(projectRunner): mount routes, systemd-run cgroup wrap, ProjectDetail Runners tab\n\nCloses review items #11 and #15 from docs/superpowers/reviews/2026-05-13-project-dev-server-review.md\nand wires the previously-dormant subsystem into both backend and frontend.\n\nBackend mount (#15)\n- bootstrap/app.ts: PREVIEW_PROXY_PATH regex bypasses Bearer auth for\n  /api/projects/:pid/runners/:rid/preview/* (preview-token cookie/query is\n  the equivalent gate). seal-cookie still requires Bearer since the host\n  page calls it via apiFetch. registerProjectRunnerRoutes(app) mounted\n  before profilesRoutes to dodge that router''s wildcard auth middleware.\n- index.ts: registerProjectRunnerShutdown() called at boot step 5b so the\n  SIGTERM/SIGINT drain hooks are installed before Bun.serve starts.\n\nsystemd-run cgroup wrap (#11)\n- config/sandbox/{types,index}.ts: DEV_SERVER_DEFAULTS (MemoryHigh=4G,\n  CPUQuota=400%, TasksMax=2048) exported alongside EXEC_PROFILE_DEFAULTS.\n- runnerSpawner.ts: spawn wrapped in `systemd-run --user --scope --quiet\n  -p MemoryHigh=4096M -p CPUQuota=400% -p TasksMax=2048 setsid bash -c …`,\n  reusing buildSystemdRunPrefixExec() from services/tools/runAsUser.ts.\n  When systemd-run --user is unavailable, prefix is empty → bare\n  `setsid bash -c …` runs (warning logged once). PGID accounting solved\n  via a sentinel: the wrapper bash echoes \"__BONOBO_DEVSERVER_PGID__=$$\"\n  before exec''ing bwrap; the spawner reads it off stdout and rewrites\n  handle.setsidPid to the real session-leader PID before piping the rest\n  to the log buffer.\n- Extracted pure buildSpawnArgv() helper for unit-testable command shape.\n\nFrontend wiring\n- ProjectDetail.tsx: new Mantine `<Tabs.Tab value=\"runners\">` with\n  IconPlayerPlay glyph. Tab body mounts <RunConfigsPanel projectId\n  onSelectRunner=…>; when a runner is selected, stacks <RunnerPreview>\n  + <RunnerLogView> beneath. selectedRid auto-clears when the runner\n  disappears from useRunnersStore (covers stop, crash, setAllForProject\n  refresh).\n\nTests\n- authBypass.test.ts (new, 8 tests): predicate semantics + integration\n  through buildApp() — preview path without Bearer is 404 from the\n  handler (not 401 from auth); sibling /runners POST without Bearer\n  still 401.\n- runnerSpawner.test.ts: +7 tests for buildSpawnArgv argv shape with /\n  without systemd-run prefix and one-shot warn latch.\n- previewProxyWs.test.ts: pre-existing port-rollover bug in the\n  closed-port reject test fixed (clamp to 1024..65535 range).\n- Full suite: 109 pass / 0 fail across services/projectRunner,\n  routes/projects, bootstrap.\n\nNote for operators: this host lacks `systemd-run --user --scope`\n(linger not enabled), so the cgroup caps are NOT enforced in dev.\nBare `setsid bwrap` runs as fallback. Enable lingering with\n`loginctl enable-linger $USER` to activate the caps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e652c4bd7b33ee8f350a36e5790d94bfd1e9ceca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/e652c4bd7b33ee8f350a36e5790d94bfd1e9ceca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKDJjNGUwZTBkOGUyNTcwNTkxZWZmZjQ2N2Q2M2I1Y2I0NzYzMTNlZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26","sha":"a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26"}],"sha":"2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/2c4e0e0d8e2570591efff467d63b5cb476313ef9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T04:37:03Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T04:37:03Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"fix(projectRunner): state-machine, storage, and proxy hardening from 2026-05-13 review\n\nCloses 10 of the 15 issues from docs/superpowers/reviews/2026-05-13-project-dev-server-review.md.\nPhase 4 (spec gaps #11-#15) and route mounting remain deferred.\n\nPhase 1 — runnerRegistry state-machine\n- markExited / markRunning gain terminal-state guards so prior crashed/exited\n  states are no longer overwritten by late-firing callbacks (#1, #2).\n- Add `stopping` handle flag + `markStopping(rid)` so SIGTERM-induced exits\n  during deliberate stops are classified as exited, not crashed (#6).\n- shutdownAll now flips `stopping` before SIGTERM.\n\nPhase 2 — storage cleanup\n- projects.ts DELETE handler SIGTERMs in-flight runners (best-effort, no\n  await) and calls deleteAllForProject before deleting the project row (#3).\n- runnerStore.updateConfig falls back to existing env when patch.env is\n  undefined, preventing silent NULL writes (#4).\n- logBuffer.drain snapshots subscribers before iterating and resets drops\n  inside the callback try block, so unsubscribe-during-callback can no\n  longer skip the next subscriber (#5).\n\nPhase 3 — preview proxy hardening\n- previewProxy rewrites absolute Location headers pointing at the upstream\n  port back to the proxy path, strips previewToken from any redirect query,\n  and passes through relative / external Locations unchanged (#7).\n- STRIPPED_RESPONSE_HEADERS now includes strict-transport-security and\n  x-frame-options so a dev server cannot poison the bonobo origin (#8).\n- sealCookieHeader takes the Request and only emits Secure when the\n  request is HTTPS (X-Forwarded-Proto aware). projectRunnerRoutes updated\n  for the new signature (#9).\n- proxyPreviewWs `ready` promise rejects on error/close before open\n  instead of hanging forever (#10).\n\nTests: +21 deterministic tests across runnerRegistry, runnerStore,\nlogBuffer, previewProxy, previewProxyWs, previewToken.\n`bun test src/__tests__/services/projectRunner/ src/__tests__/routes/projects/`\n→ 79 pass, 0 fail, 164 expect() calls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a1aa2da0cf91d5f2fb49ce0de9e00da3dd6d97b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/6a1aa2da0cf91d5f2fb49ce0de9e00da3dd6d97b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGE5MzNlZjlkYWQwYmZjZTI4OWMyNTcxNmE2NTkxYTRhMTZkNDNkMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef","sha":"c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef"}],"sha":"a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/a933ef9dad0bfce289c25716a6591a4a16d43d26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:17:06Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:17:06Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"feat(server): POST /api/install-runs + drop stale AddHostWizard JSDoc\n\nFollow-ups from the onboarding-flow merge:\n\n1. Add public POST /api/install-runs so the onboarding ModelsStep Install\n   button can launch the install pipeline (previously the pipeline was\n   only reachable via the install_model_for_hardware macro tool).\n   - Body: { repoId, quantHint?, capability? }\n   - Validates repoId is a non-empty string (400 otherwise)\n   - Creates a row via createInstallRun + pins candidateRepo, then fires\n     startPipeline in the background and returns { runId } with 202\n   - 4 route tests cover validation + the happy path (with startPipeline\n     mocked to avoid hitting HF in the test suite)\n\n2. Update src/hooks/hosts/useHosts.ts JSDoc: \"Hosts settings tab + AddHostWizard\"\n   → \"Hosts settings tab + onboarding flow\". AddHostWizard was deleted in\n   the merge but the doc reference lingered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9ea556c2af569c3ee3865ef388cb735e2b141ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/b9ea556c2af569c3ee3865ef388cb735e2b141ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGMyYTM1NmViOTM5MGRkNDM3MjcxMjJkYzMwNTBmOTkxN2ZhMDg0ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/34892ee5b98678eb1ea62a47d3c5a06e937145ff","sha":"34892ee5b98678eb1ea62a47d3c5a06e937145ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/34892ee5b98678eb1ea62a47d3c5a06e937145ff"}],"sha":"c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/c2a356eb9390dd43727122dc3050f9917fa084ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/34892ee5b98678eb1ea62a47d3c5a06e937145ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:11:12Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:11:12Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"Merge feature/onboarding-flow — unified onboarding + add-host flow\n\nImplements the 34-task plan from docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-15-onboarding-add-host*.md:\n\nPhase 1 (12 tasks, backend):\n- Shared Zod schemas (BindingSuggestion, ModelGap) in @bonobo/shared-schemas\n- bindingRecommender + modelGapDetector services\n- onboardingStore (dismissed flag) with corruption tolerance\n- POST /api/hosts/probe-all (fan-out across all registered providers)\n- POST /api/onboarding/{recommend-bindings,model-gaps,dismiss}\n- GET /api/onboarding/state, GET /api/system/auth-bootstrap-status (public)\n- recommended-models.json + boot-time drift assertion\n- Live integration test against melmbox\n\nPhase 2 (11 tasks, state machine + hooks):\n- src/components/onboarding/machine.ts: 7-step discriminated union,\n  14-action reducer with cachedProbes + hiddenGapKeys + persistence\n- 36 reducer/persistence tests covering every action × step transition,\n  the SKIP per-step destination table, and serialize/deserialize roundtrips\n- useOnboardingMachine (reducer + localStorage), useOnboardingDismissed\n- Thin API hooks: useProbeAll, useBindingSuggestions, useModelGaps,\n  useAuthBootstrapStatus\n\nPhase 3 (11 tasks, UI):\n- <OnboardingFlow> chrome with Skip/Close + step switch\n- 7 step components: Auth, Welcome, Identity, Discover, Bind, Models, Done\n- <FirstRunOverlay> mounted in AppLayout (gated on no hosts || no token)\n- <AddHostModal> + HostsPanel cutover (replaces legacy AddHostWizard)\n- Legacy AddHostWizard + useProbe deleted\n- happy-dom + @testing-library/react wired via src/bunfig.toml for RTL tests\n\nTest totals: 116/116 onboarding tests pass (57 server + 55 frontend + 4 shared).\nTypecheck: zero new errors on onboarding files.\nLive test passes against melmbox.\n\nKnown follow-ups (NOT in this branch):\n- POST /api/install-runs endpoint needs to be added so ModelsStep\n  Install button can trigger the install pipeline (currently the\n  pipeline is only triggered via the install_model_for_hardware tool).\n- Stale JSDoc in src/hooks/hosts/useHosts.ts mentions AddHostWizard.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tserver/src/__tests__/lint/frontendAuthHygiene.test.ts","tree":{"sha":"c12ee50bf8926b9c24bc3952870f307d52493fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/c12ee50bf8926b9c24bc3952870f307d52493fd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/34892ee5b98678eb1ea62a47d3c5a06e937145ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"