github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/2cbcbf325cbe8b3c8f30ddd1b137113246b56f1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:00:46Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T04:00:46Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"fix(server): isolate recommendedModels drift test from registry resets\n\nOther test suites in the onboarding-flow branch call\n_resetProvidersForTesting() to test provider-aware logic. When those\nsuites run before recommendedModels.test.ts in the same process, the\nglobal provider registry is empty and assertNoRecommendedModelDrift\nsees keys like \"embed.ollama\" with no matching registered provider.\n\nAdd a beforeAll guard that detects an empty registry and re-imports the\nstandard provider modules to re-register them. The side-effect import\nabove ensures the modules are kept by the module loader so we can\nre-register on demand.\n\nWith this fix all 57 server onboarding tests pass when run together.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55a0c95a66e86682354e060bc1cc44a28ad61cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/55a0c95a66e86682354e060bc1cc44a28ad61cac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/2cbcbf325cbe8b3c8f30ddd1b137113246b56f1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","