eM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/b6c539b6c493dbcb9286ad0405b04fe91fa3cf20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:45:16Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:45:16Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"Merge branch ''worktree-test-failure-triage'' — fix 15 stale test failures\n\nTriage of the 86-fail test suite revealed ~20 genuine fails (rest are\ntest-pollution cascades). This branch fixes the 15 most tractable:\n\n- frontendAuthHygiene: refresh STREAMING_FETCH_ALLOWLIST for moved/new\n  SSE-via-fetch hooks (2 fails).\n- modelPresets: replace stale `synthetic-qwen3.5-397b` preset id with\n  dynamic provider-based lookup (3 fails).\n- mcpClient DEFAULT_MCP_SERVERS: install runtime fixture so Phase-G\n  resolver populates URLs; assert against getMcpServers() instead of\n  the eager export (2 fails).\n- installPipeline/resolveCandidate: update \"below floor\" case to the\n  post-Phase-D2 fail+suggestion behavior (1 fail).\n- downloadCoordinator/lifecycle: stub Phase-C4 applyTerminalCapAfterBoot\n  no-op so the test''s hand-rolled DownloadStore doesn''t throw on boot\n  (7 fails — single missing method cascaded across all 7 boot tests).\n\nFull sweep: 86 → 72 fails.\n\nDeferred to a follow-up:\n- 5 downloadFile fails — Bun mock.module doesn''t apply reliably across\n  consecutive `it()` blocks; needs test redesign.\n- ~65 cascading pollution fails — each file passes in isolation,\n  poisons subsequent files in the larger sweep. Bisect needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude 