//api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/e91e484b6433e98d3dd971116cb1b980d1c7b2e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:42:58Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:42:58Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"feat(memory-graph): context-tree sidebar metadata + per-round token usage\n\nSidebar polish + persistence:\n- Auto-scaled durations (350ms / 1.2s / 2m 5s) replace raw ms in row chips\n  and the expanded footer\n- Relative timestamps (5m ago / 2h ago) with absolute on hover\n- Model name + avatar, completion tokens, and tokens/sec on each assistant\n  row; extracted ContextRowMeta + metaFormat helpers to share between the\n  collapsed chip and expanded footer (eliminates prior duplication)\n- Persist tokenStats to Dexie (tokensTotal + tokensPerSec) so the stats\n  survive page reloads\n\nPer-round token usage pipeline:\n- New `round_usage` SSE event (RoundUsageEventSchema in @bonobo/shared-schemas)\n  emitted by runRoundLoop after each tool round with {round, promptTokens,\n  completionTokens, ms}\n- Dispatcher routes it via onRoundUsage; appendLastMessageRoundUsage in\n  conversationStore replaces-by-round-number so retries are idempotent\n- Persisted to Dexie as a JSON column; forwarded through useMemoryGraphData\n  and projected onto GraphNode in memoryGraphService\n- Rendered as a nested per-round breakdown in the expanded footer for\n  multi-round turns only (single-round turns are fully described by totals)\n\nType plumbing:\n- Module-augment MemoryGraphNode in src/types/bonoboUi.d.ts with the four\n  assistant fields + RoundUsage — host reads typed fields without a\n  Record<string, unknown> cast. No @bonobo/ui publish required; the block\n  promotes cleanly into the library on its next bump.\n\nTests:\n- shared: 121/121 (round_usage fixture added)\n- sidebar + metaFormat: 44/44\n- conversationStore: 4/4 (incl. appendLastMessageRoundUsage)\n- memoryGraphService: 2/2\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16b51827850308a41cfa35fe129a7c4a263c3be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/16b51827850308a41cfa35fe129a7c4a263c3be3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/e91e484b6433e98d3dd971116cb1b980d1c7b2e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/e91e484b6433e98d3dd971116cb1b980d1c7b2e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGU5MWU0ODRiNjQzM2U5OGQzZGQ5NzExMTZjYjFiOTgwZDFjN2IyZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9","sha":"f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9"}],"sha":"e91e484b6433e98d3dd971116cb1b980d1c7b2e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/e91e484b6433e98d3dd971116cb1b980d1c7b2e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/b497c1eee69baba983b2a59a75f72ff18d5eed23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:40:29Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:40:29Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"test(triage): fix 15 stale test failures across 5 files\n\nTriage of 86 failing tests revealed 20 genuine bugs vs ~65 cascading\npollution from polluted module state. This commit fixes the 15 most\ntractable real failures:\n\n- lint/frontendAuthHygiene — STREAMING_FETCH_ALLOWLIST drifted.\n  hooks/useModelPortalEvents.ts moved to hooks/modelPortal/. Three new\n  hooks (useInstallRun, useProjectFilesWatcher, useHostHealth) added\n  raw SSE fetch calls because EventSource can''t carry Bearer auth.\n  Refresh allowlist (+3 new, -1 stale path). [2 fails]\n- config/modelPresets — `synthetic-qwen3.5-397b` is a pre-Phase-6\n  preset id that no longer exists in the seeded remote_models table.\n  Replace with dynamic provider-based lookup\n  (`firstSyntheticPresetId() = find p.baseUrl.includes(\"synthetic.new\")`)\n  so the suite survives future seed-list rotations. [3 fails]\n- services/mcp/mcpClient — eager-evaluated `DEFAULT_MCP_SERVERS`\n  captures empty URLs at module load when no capabilities runtime\n  exists (Phase G dropUnresolvedHostUrls filters them). Refactor the\n  Default-server structural describe block to install a runtime\n  fixture in beforeEach and assert against `getMcpServers()`. [2 fails]\n- installPipeline/phases/resolveCandidate — \"dominant ratio but below\n  absolute floor → halts\" expected the pre-Phase-D2 behavior. After\n  D2 (phantom-query rejection) the resolver returns `fail` with a\n  \"did you mean\" suggestion list instead. Update assertion to match\n  the new + more useful behavior. [1 fail]\n- downloadCoordinator/lifecycle — hand-rolled DownloadStore stub\n  missing the Phase C4 `applyTerminalCapAfterBoot()` method. Add as\n  a no-op (return 0 evictions) so the boot path doesn''t throw\n  TypeError. [7 fails — all 7 boot-path tests cascaded from one\n  missing method]\n\nTest deltas:\n- Full sweep 86 → 72 fails (delta of 14; one cluster overlap)\n- 5 remaining downloadFile fails need the Bun mock.module hoisting\n  + cross-`it()` state-leak issue redesigned — deferred.\n- ~65 cascading pollution fails remain (each file passes alone but\n  fails in the larger sweep). Separate \"find the polluter\" investigation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e42155804f6f3341640c86ee5d2a94816de8b90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/5e42155804f6f3341640c86ee5d2a94816de8b90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/b497c1eee69baba983b2a59a75f72ff18d5eed23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/b497c1eee69baba983b2a59a75f72ff18d5eed23","node_id":"C_kwDOTbBDAtoAKGI0OTdjMWVlZTY5YmFiYTk4M2IyYTU5YTc1ZjcyZmYxOGQ1ZWVkMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commit/f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9","sha":"f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/f5cea20e093a25acaec1d6ccb73e19d9f58cc1d9"}],"sha":"b497c1eee69baba983b2a59a75f72ff18d5eed23","ur