260db08e3970536aa0ed62594419928222d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/81d260db08e3970536aa0ed62594419928222d8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/commits/ce180e72dae99ca1f0c9c327de6a03433a4005b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:07:10Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T03:07:10Z","email":"ishevch@pm.me","name":"Ilya Shevchenko"},"message":"Merge branch ''worktree-caps-phase-g'' — Phase G capabilities hygiene + cleanup\n\nThree items from the F→G deferred list:\n\nG#1. CI grep guard (__tests__/lint/melmboxLiteralsHygiene.test.ts) —\n     fails loud if any non-allowlisted source picks up MELMBOX_HOST,\n     RAIDBOX_HOST, the \"melmbox\" string, or 192.168.30.50.\nG#2. CAPABILITIES_BOOT_GATE removed — capabilities subsystem always\n     runs. seedHostLocal guarantees a usable runtime even without\n     operator config.\nG#3. networkRegistry.ts deleted. The Host/HostService schema gained\n     optional topology fields (role/os/hardware, displayName/healthPath/\n     apiSpecPath/apiLabel/protocol) so the 4 diagnostic consumers\n     (systemInfo, generateNetworkDiagram, cliToolLayer, benchmarks\n     route) iterate the runtime host store directly. mcpServersStore\n     resolvers are inlined and return \"\" (Path 2: no IP fallback),\n     and a dropUnresolvedHostUrls filter prevents malformed URLs.\n     Operator-run benchmarks now fail loud without explicit env vars.\n\nExit criteria:\n- networkRegistry.ts no longer exists.\n- Phase-G allowlist down to 4 files.\n- Test suite delta: same 30 pre-existing failures, no new regressions.\n\nNote: lost ~1 hour mid-implementation to a git stash misuse. Memory\nfile feedback_no_stash_during_active_work.md updated with the failure\nmode for future me.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fcb65b1c818a1e5bef11b2b132ffd1e417ddff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/trees/5fcb65b1c818a1e5bef11b2b132ffd1e417ddff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JungleM0nkey/bonobo-terminal/git/commits/ce180e72dae99ca1f0c9c327de6a03433a4005b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37726736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JungleM0nkey","id":37726736,"login":"JungleM0nkey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzI2NzM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JungleM0nkey/receiv