he parser\nto reach the second section''s slot, as a project page waits for its stage.\nPainted half-streamed, the hero grew once the rest arrived and took its\nbottom-anchored orb down with it: a 0.07 layout shift on one mobile run in\nthree. Each section''s slot gets an id for it (slot-<module>).","tree":{"sha":"60776c886f68d87bdd2179b712d06f822b4b5843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/60776c886f68d87bdd2179b712d06f822b4b5843"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/c574daf4ab75a73a827cde64653d0cdcd64527a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/c574daf4ab75a73a827cde64653d0cdcd64527a8","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGM1NzRkYWY0YWI3NWE3M2E4MjdjZGU2NDY1M2QwY2RjZDY0NTI3YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/96f4fe37e25889a7c32b4b0e37f562c54ad5fbc2","sha":"96f4fe37e25889a7c32b4b0e37f562c54ad5fbc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/96f4fe37e25889a7c32b4b0e37f562c54ad5fbc2"}],"sha":"c574daf4ab75a73a827cde64653d0cdcd64527a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/c574daf4ab75a73a827cde64653d0cdcd64527a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/96f4fe37e25889a7c32b4b0e37f562c54ad5fbc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:44:19Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:44:19Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"ci(lighthouse): hold every page type at 100 on mobile and desktop\n\n.github/workflows/lighthouse.yml runs Lighthouse CI on every pull request\nand push to main: home, blog, a post and each project, all four\ncategories at 100 on the median of three runs, mobile and desktop, each\nsplit over three jobs.\n\nIt measures the production build served from the runner:\nscripts/lighthouse/serve.mjs serves every remote (vite preview), the\nhost''s Nitro server and a stand-in CMS with one fixture post, each behind a\nproxy that compresses as the CDN does, on the .env ports (or shifted by\nLH_PORT_OFFSET, beside a dev stack). lighthouserc.cjs measures with\nDevTools throttling: the default simulation replays the unthrottled load\nand counts whatever finished before the first paint as needed for it, and\non localhost that is all of the hydration JavaScript. The desktop preset''s\nlink is applied explicitly, since the preset leaves DevTools throttling\noff.\n\nLighthouse CI runs through a pinned `pnpm dlx` (`pnpm lighthouse`): as a\ndevDependency its tree carries high advisories with no fixed release, in a\nbrowser download it never uses here.","tree":{"sha":"1cc18353097257b28c38bd8f1b1f19dc0a29d79c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/1cc18353097257b28c38bd8f1b1f19dc0a29d79c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/96f4fe37e25889a7c32b4b0e37f562c54ad5fbc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"