age":"perf(holodex): render the effects gallery from its captured cards\n\n- Every tile renders first from its card as captured (the tile query''s\n  placeholderData, effect-gallery.fixture.ts renamed .cards.ts), server\n  render included: the first paint has all the art and names, where\n  skeletons waited seconds for TCGdex (desktop LCP 5.8 s). A failed\n  request keeps the captured copy.\n- Images show as they arrive in the server''s markup; the fade over their\n  placeholder is the client''s, from mount (useImageFallback''s `hidden`).\n  Held at opacity 0 until hydration, the first screen''s art counted for\n  nothing, not even as the LCP.\n- The first section''s three cards draw from this remote''s own copy of\n  their art (public/gallery, copied from TCGdex by `pnpm assets`, not\n  committed): assets.tcgdex.net has no CDN, and a new connection there\n  cost ~0.9 s on a desktop profile.\n- The rarity chips are set in the system face: Inter landing after the\n  first paint re-wrapped them and moved every section below (CLS 0.07).\n- The accent reaches 4.5:1 as a text colour on the panel.","tree":{"sha":"3d6ee1c6c8f7c5294183f2aab36e583f69b0ff86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/3d6ee1c6c8f7c5294183f2aab36e583f69b0ff86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/e4de3d8295461490b50b16018c3c3a0f90ce8945","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organiz