nminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/d1b798767a892181da92cf9af836c811ea846ad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:43:46Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:43:46Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"perf(bali): self-host the hero layers as AVIF\n\n- The hero''s three parallax layers were 1 MB of PNG on an external CDN, on\n  the first screen. They are self-hosted in src/assets/hero as AVIF at\n  three widths (a phone fetches ~110 KB) with a WebP fallback, imported so\n  they resolve against this remote''s origin in the host too.\n- The destinations glow sits inside its section: bled 10rem up, it was on\n  the first screen until the hero''s pin spacer arrived with the script and\n  took the section a screen down (a 0.07 layout shift).\n- The @font-face rules ride in the SSR CSS, on this remote''s origin.\n- Accessibility: the star ratings are images with their label, the logo\n  keeps its visible wordmark in its name, and the itinerary''s faint day\n  counter is decoration, drawn as generated content hidden from assistive\n  tech.","tree":{"sha":"94b2e79039f9e2c9daf3f75a1b044a3a8f5de42c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/94b2e79039f9e2c9daf3f75a1b044a3a8f5de42c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/d1b798767a892181da92cf9af836c811ea846ad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_i