"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:43:12Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:43:12Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"perf(toonhub): serve the figurines as AVIF and move them by transform\n\n- The page served its 2160x2880 PNGs, 5-7 MB each. `pnpm assets` now\n  derives AVIF and WebP at six widths from them with sharp (8-260 KB each,\n  not committed), and the hero offers them in a <picture> srcset. The PNG\n  sources move to assets/figurines/, out of what is deployed.\n- The centre figurine is the page''s LCP: fetchpriority=\"high\", at its drawn\n  size. The side ones start on small files and are widened once the page\n  has loaded, each taking the centre in turn.\n- Roles move by transform only: every figurine sits in the centre''s box and\n  is drawn at its role''s place in the carousel''s container units. Moving\n  left/height/bottom was a layout shift on every frame of every slide\n  (CLS 0.18 on a phone, 0.28 on a desktop).\n- The entrance is CSS keyframes from the first paint instead of flags the\n  controller set on hydration, which blanked a hero the visitor was already\n  looking at and faded it back in.\n- The CTA keeps its visible label in its accessible name.","tree":{"sha":"7d46d595ff50e828cc7587f8b0ffb940fd3273c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/7d46d595ff50e828cc7587f8b0ffb940fd3273c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/249d7ce798607eaeba3f5bc6b94569f2b04ec4ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht