ttps://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/232ccd85e943e6fadd98cb069aa0e697834f278b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:37Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:37Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"perf(profile): show the hero from the first paint\n\n- The hero''s entrance is CSS keyframes from the first paint (heroChar,\n  heroIntro), not a GSAP timeline gated on hydration: on a slow phone the\n  copy stayed hidden until the JavaScript arrived (LCP 3.2 s). The copy\n  rises without fading, since Chrome counts text first painted at opacity 0\n  only at its next repaint.\n- The name is sized to fit \"MINH NGUYEN\" on one line at any width\n  (8.2cqw of the column; it measures 11.8em in Syne 800, not the 11em the\n  8.8cqw assumed), so the swap from its fallback no longer re-wraps it and\n  moves everything below.\n- On a phone the hero''s copy starts at the top rather than centred: a hero\n  still streaming in re-centred with every block and shifted the page.\n- Accessibility: the stack cards are a real list, the project cards''\n  status and link text reach 4.5:1 in light mode, and the outline marquee\n  stroke 3:1.","tree":{"sha":"3740f6e550964271ea526598c1fe07f2252c0af1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/3740f6e550964271ea526598c1fe07f2252c0af1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/232ccd85e943e6fadd98cb069aa0e697834f278b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://