/api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/feb6e8b76cf63f527fe5abc72495b9372dcfef85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:22Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:42:22Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"perf(portfolio): paint the first screen without waiting on scripts\n\n- app.css is inlined into the server-rendered <head> (?inline), so the\n  first paint waits for no stylesheet request.\n- src/server.ts streams the HTML through lib/low-priority-preloads.ts:\n  TanStack Start''s modulepreload links go to fetchpriority=\"low\", and a\n  project page drops them, since its first screen is the remote''s and ten\n  host chunks shared a phone''s link with the remote''s LCP image. The entry\n  script still loads them all.\n- A project page with server markup holds its first paint for the end of\n  the stage (<link rel=\"expect\" href=\"#stage-end\" blocking=\"render\">), so a\n  remote laid out from the bottom or the middle never paints half-streamed\n  and then moves (a 0.17 layout shift on Viktor).\n- The back pill over a remote is set in the system face (Inter was a 47 KB\n  download for one word there) and shrinks to its arrow on a phone, where\n  it covered Mindloop''s first social link (target-size).","tree":{"sha":"dbce9c0c41a45a699db0eca17336f40d3d6796b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/dbce9c0c41a45a699db0eca17336f40d3d6796b8"},"url":"https://api.githu