685f7e593e49470813e52b9115f7a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:46:57Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:48:04Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"fix(portfolio): send the security headers from a Build Output route\n\nvercel.json `headers` need not reach a deployment whose Build Output\nNitro writes itself, and a ''/**'' route rule is no better: Nitro emits a\nrule''s headers as a route without `continue`, and a catch-all that stops\nrouting would keep every page from reaching the server function.\n\nDeclare them in nitro.vercel.config.routes instead, which Nitro puts\nfirst in .vercel/output/config.json, as { src: ''/(.*)'', headers,\ncontinue: true }. A NITRO_PRESET=vercel build shows that route first and\nthe generated ones (assets, filesystem, ISR, /__server) unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"bddd23760347e965ec4cbcd718455765d952f2d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/bddd23760347e965ec4cbcd718455765d952f2d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/95d034e635685f7e593e49470813e52b9115f7a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/95d034e635685f7e593e49470813e52b9115f7a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKDk1ZDAzNGU2MzU2ODVmN2U1OTNlNDk0NzA4MTNlNTJiOTExNWY3YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/d2d5b37c95c982e1301c3a4c02548586a47966ec","sha":"d2d5b37c95c982e1301c3a4c02548586a47966ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/d2d5b37c95c982e1301c3a4c02548586a47966ec"}],"sha":"95d034e635685f7e593e49470813e52b9115f7a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/95d034e635685f7e593e49470813e52b9115f7a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/d2d5b37c95c982e1301c3a4c02548586a47966ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:41:46Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:41:46Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"fix(portfolio): stop pages inheriting og.png''s alt text and size\n\nThe root head started sending og:image:width, og:image:height and\nog:image:alt for og.png while the blog built its own image tags with\nneither alt nor, for an unsized upload, a size. Head tags merge by name\nand a child route cannot drop a parent''s, so a post''s image was\ndescribed with og.png''s alt text and, when unsized, its 1200x630.\n\nsocialImageMeta() in lib/site.ts now builds every page''s image tags:\nalt text always (the post title when the upload has none), the size only\nwhen both sides are known. The root sends og.png through it unsized; /,\n/blog and posts without an image send it again with its size. SITE_IMAGE\nreplaces the two copies of og.png''s description, which disagreed.\n\nAlso left over from building the head and the blog in parallel: the blog\nnow uses json-ld.ts''s serialiseJsonLd() instead of a second copy of it,\nand /blog''s CollectionPage is part of the WebSite / declares.","tree":{"sha":"9946391e744538926a3c14c52c610f3deaf688d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/9946391e744538926a3c14c52c610f3deaf688d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/d2d5b37c95c982e1301c3a4c02548586a47966ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800