\n\nlib/json-ld.ts now builds both graphs. / declares the WebSite (#website,\npublished by the Person) and the Person (#person: AUTHOR_NAME, the site image,\nknowsAbout and sameAs from the profile remote''s data); a project''s CreativeWork\ntakes its thumbnail as image, the Person as author and the WebSite as isPartOf,\nby @id. site.ts gains PERSON_ID and AUTHOR_NAME, which the blog uses too. The\nhome JSON-LD goes through the same <-escaping serialiser as the projects''.","tree":{"sha":"9cd004ac39348d38698b5c307a4b55fa12b11fe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/9cd004ac39348d38698b5c307a4b55fa12b11fe6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/ffb2ff8d0f30e88b56386921468ec8c491e50f14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/ffb2ff8d0f30e88b56386921468ec8c491e50f14","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGZmYjJmZjhkMGYzMGU4OGI1NjM4NjkyMTQ2OGVjOGM0O