 alt text and a twitter:description. Tags merge by name, so projectHead\ngives each thumbnail an alt of its own instead of inheriting og.png''s.\n\ntheme-color was only ever written by the theme script, so the server''s HTML\nhad none. The root head now sends the dark tint scoped to a dark system (the\nno-JS page themes from the tokens alone); the script takes that tag over,\ndropping media and writing the resolved colour, and syncThemeColor does the\nsame.","tree":{"sha":"e71474e658549c26aa8676324ae6ef7d19dc3486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/e71474e658549c26aa8676324ae6ef7d19dc3486"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/b29bfec22fdc2108454d959dc57bb658490ea46e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/b29bfec22fdc2108454d959dc57bb658490ea46e","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGIyOWJmZWMyMmZkYzIxMDg0NTRkOTU5ZGM1N2JiNjU4NDkwZWE0NmU","pa