 these should not be in a sitemap,\nso Holodex lists sets alone.","tree":{"sha":"b752a7fe379c9e6aa8cc8387a5682bdff489a0fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/b752a7fe379c9e6aa8cc8387a5682bdff489a0fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/c3e8ad013663ae89758a457c28ffa2755aec57b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/c3e8ad013663ae89758a457c28ffa2755aec57b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGMzZThhZDAxMzY2M2FlODk3NThhNDU3YzI4ZmZhMjc1NWFlYzU3YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a","sha":"23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a"}],"sha":"c3e8ad013663ae89758a457c28ffa2755aec57b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/c3e8ad013663ae89758a457c28ffa2755aec57b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:32:01Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"fix(cms): never date a post''s last change before its publication\n\nA smoke run against Strapi 5.54 showed how it dates a published entry:\npublishing copies the draft, updatedAt included, and stamps publishedAt\nafterwards. The published updatedAt is therefore the last edit before the\nlatest publish, always a little (or a lot) earlier than publishedAt, so\ndateModified and article:modified_time came out before datePublished.\n\nlastChange() takes the later of the two, which is when the public post\nlast changed; both mappers use it.","tree":{"sha":"ea0f9de11df583b934ba7f46a29cce61132c7c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/ea0f9de11df583b934ba7f46a29cce61132c7c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKDIzYjhhNDRkZGViMGU3ZmMzODBlZjllMmIxNzRmNjQyZDdmY2Y5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c","sha":"b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c"}],"sha":"23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/23b8a44ddeb0e7fc380ef9e2b174f642d7fcf97a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:27:34Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"feat(portfolio): add llms.txt and an RSS feed for the blog\n\n/llms.txt follows the llmstxt.org format: the site''s name as H1, a\none-line summary, then links to home, the blog, each live project with\nits tagline and the ten newest indexable posts, plus the feed and the\nsitemap under Optional. /blog/rss.xml is RSS 2.0 with atom:link\nrel=\"self\" and the 20 newest posts, CMS text XML-escaped and stripped of\ncharacters XML forbids. The feed keeps noindexed posts, which only search\nindexes should skip.\n\nBoth are server routes built per request, like the sitemap, so a post\nshows up without a deploy; without the CMS they still render, minus the\nposts. The feed sits under the /blog/** swr rule and refreshes within a\nminute, like the blog. /blog and every post link it with\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\">.","tree":{"sha":"58432dd3735e40c8dfc4b6d1f99b70c27512f45c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/58432dd3735e40c8dfc4b6d1f99b70c27512f45c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGIyZjkyZjY4NzQwNmVhM2U5NTBhYzI3ZjNjZWIzZTQyMDg0NTJiMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e","sha":"43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e"}],"sha":"b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/b2f92f687406ea3e950ac27f3ceb3e4208452b0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:22:03Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"feat(portfolio): complete the blog''s structured data and meta\n\nA post''s BlogPosting gains dateModified, the SEO image (which already\nfalls back to the cover), mainEntityOfPage, an @id the blog index reuses,\nand an author and publisher that point at the Person `/` describes by\n`${SITE_URL}/#person`. PERSON_ID and AUTHOR_NAME live in lib/site.ts so\nevery page names that one Person the same way. The name is \"Minh Nguyen\",\nprofile.name in apps/profile, which the home page already used; the\nproject stage''s \"Nguyen Cao Anh Minh\" is the profile''s fullName.\n\nThe post''s head adds article:modified_time and og:image width and height\nwhen the CMS knows them (the site''s og.png when the post has no image),\nand follows the CMS''s new canonicalURL and metaRobots when an editor sets\nthem. /blog gets CollectionPage + Blog JSON-LD and an absolute og:image.\n\nThe head and JSON-LD builders move to lib/blog-seo.ts, next to the URL\nhelpers the sitemap uses, and are unit tested there.","tree":{"sha":"bb4bf96f4aa536f3c1e0051d74ef88e42c03f048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/bb4bf96f4aa536f3c1e0051d74ef88e42c03f048"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKDQzMjQzZDc4NjYxYWMzZDNhZjdmOGQ0OTc1OGVjZDE3NGExMzk5N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/1c3f866d21b69301be786738d1707bcf19c2d7fe","sha":"1c3f866d21b69301be786738d1707bcf19c2d7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/1c3f866d21b69301be786738d1707bcf19c2d7fe"}],"sha":"43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/43243d78661ac3d3af7f8d49758ecd174a13997e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/1c3f866d21b69301be786738d1707bcf19c2d7fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:18:11Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"feat(portfolio): serve robots.txt and sitemap.xml at request time\n\nThe site-files Vite plugin emitted both at build time, so the sitemap\ncould never list a blog post: posts change in the CMS without a deploy.\nBoth are now TanStack Start server routes built per request by pure\nbuilders in lib/site-files.ts, and the plugin and its dev-server copy of\nthe same strings are gone, so nothing in public/ shadows the routes.\n\nThe sitemap lists /, /blog, every live project with the static pages the\nregistry gives a route-aware one (Holodex: sets, search, collection), and\nevery post from fetchArticleIndex with updatedAt as lastmod, except posts\nthat are noindexed or canonicalised to another URL (lib/blog-seo.ts).\nchangefreq and priority are dropped, and no other page gets a guessed\nlastmod. When the CMS does not answer within 4 s the static entries still\nrender, cached 60 s instead of an hour so the posts come back soon.\n\nrobots.txt still allows everything, names the AI search and training\ncrawlers explicitly in an allow-all group, and points at the sitemap.","tree":{"sha":"32a5899426d53f3de1178e228f720c78ca661ace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/32a5899426d53f3de1178e228f720c78ca661ace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/1c3f866d21b69301be786738d1707bcf19c2d7fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"ht