nn104/ncam.dev/commits/fd933b676fb2b2a0c862260b26db04b488a60e42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:06:21Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"fix(remotes): give TOONHUB and Holodex standalone canonicals\n\nBoth remotes serve their index.html on their own Vercel URL too, with\nnothing to say it duplicates the host''s project page: TOONHUB''s was\ntitled \"remote preview\" and had no description, Holodex''s had a title,\na description and robots but no canonical or Open Graph.\n\nTOONHUB gets the registry''s name, tagline and description as its title\nand description, and both get the same set the other remotes carry: a\ncanonical and og:url at %SITE_URL%/projects/<id>, Open Graph and\nTwitter tags, and the host''s 1200x630 thumbnail as their image. Neither\nhad JSON-LD, and none is added.","tree":{"sha":"ed0b28227e7dfbfbc1d8ddffd826d175b5796010","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/ed0b28227e7dfbfbc1d8ddffd826d175b5796010"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/fd933b676fb2b2a0c862260b26db04b488a60e42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/fd933b676fb2b2a0c862260b26db04b488a60e42","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGZkOTMzYjY3NmZiMmIyYTBjODYyMjYwYjI2ZGIwNGI0ODhhNjBlNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee","sha":"bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee"}],"sha":"fd933b676fb2b2a0c862260b26db04b488a60e42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/fd933b676fb2b2a0c862260b26db04b488a60e42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:06:11Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"fix(remotes): canonicalise the standalone pages to the host\n\nEach remote is deployed on its own Vercel URL, and mindloop,\nimmersive-ocean, viktor and bali served their index.html there as an\nindexable page with a self-referencing canonical on <id>.ncam.dev: a\nduplicate of the host''s /projects/<id>, competing with it, and on a\ndomain that does not resolve. viktor''s og:image also named an og.png\nit never had.\n\nTheir canonical, og:url and JSON-LD url now read\n%SITE_URL%/projects/<id>, which defineRemote() fills in with the host''s\norigin, and og:image / twitter:image the host''s 1200x630 thumbnail at\n%SITE_URL%/thumbnails/<id>.jpg, the image the host''s own project page\nshares. Robots stays index,follow: the cross-domain canonical is the\nsignal, and noindex would contradict it.\n\nThe Organization nodes of mindloop and immersive-ocean lose their logo,\nwhich pointed at the same dead subdomain; nothing else in the JSON-LD\nchanges. The remotes'' own og images are unreferenced now but kept.","tree":{"sha":"a6395f8c6359ffaaeda9859726377893c3c69525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/a6395f8c6359ffaaeda9859726377893c3c69525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKGJjNzdlYmExYzM0ODQ4ZDM5YTQxMWZhMzA0MGJmODU3NDg3Mzc4ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd","sha":"4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd"}],"sha":"bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/bc77eba1c34848d39a411fa3040bf857487378ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:06:01Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"chore(turbo): pass SITE_URL through to dev\n\nThe build task already lists SITE_URL in its env, but dev declared only\nSTRAPI_*, so under Turbo 2''s strict env mode a shell\n`SITE_URL=... pnpm dev` never reached vite. The host''s dev server reads\nit for its canonical URLs, and every remote''s does now too, to fill in\nits standalone page''s canonical. Values in .env still arrive either way,\nsince env() reads those files itself.","tree":{"sha":"6d067fb8888f58c5ffdd84a6ab13055686cabcac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/6d067fb8888f58c5ffdd84a6ab13055686cabcac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd","node_id":"C_kwDOTbHv9doAKDQ3OTBiZmU2ZDE1NTYzZWYxMzk2YmVhZmUzNTRkMjJiYzY1NGMyY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104/ncam.dev/commit/21f514c10d3f26b502a68a927d93f7b73b743267","sha":"21f514c10d3f26b502a68a927d93f7b73b743267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/21f514c10d3f26b502a68a927d93f7b73b743267"}],"sha":"4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/4790bfe6d15563ef1396beafe354d22bc654c2cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/21f514c10d3f26b502a68a927d93f7b73b743267/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:05:30Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:34:29Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"feat(mf-remote): fill in %SITE_URL% in a remote''s index.html\n\nEvery remote is also deployed on its own, and its standalone index.html\nis a duplicate of the host''s /projects/<id>. Pointing its canonical at\nthe host needs the host''s origin, and typing that into seven files\nwould repeat what the host already resolves from SITE_URL at build time.\n\ndefineRemote() now installs an `ncam:site-url` plugin whose\ntransformIndexHtml (order: pre, dev and build) replaces every\n%SITE_URL% in the page with resolveSiteUrl(): SITE_URL, else\nhttps://ncam.dev, with trailing slashes dropped, as the host does. It\nskips the host''s middle step, VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL: on a\nremote''s own Vercel project that names the remote, and the canonical\nwould point back at the duplicate. A value that is not an absolute\nhttp(s) URL throws, since it would ship a relative canonical that\nresolves against the remote.\n\nTests run the installed hook over a page carrying the placeholder in a\ncanonical, og:url, og:image, twitter:image and JSON-LD, and check none\nsurvives; resolveSiteUrl() is covered for the fallback, slashes and bad\nvalues without reading the machine''s .env files.","tree":{"sha":"2f9d02eadca68cea19cf6acde3388f3e41f654ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/2f9d02eadca68cea19cf6acde3388f3e41f654ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/21f514c10d3f26b502a68a927d93f7b73b743267","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.