hub.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/commits/44d38f03be0536ea4e1cdda9814cf7f55b5fe9b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:26:26Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:26:26Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"docs: bring the root AGENTS.md in line with the repo\n\nThe root guide still described an early version of the repo: four apps\n(mindloop, immersive-ocean, viktor, bali and profile were missing), no\nmf-remote or design-tokens package, \"framework-free (no React)\" when the\nhost and six remotes run React 19, a `mount(target, config?) => () => void`\ncontract without `./ssr` or `./hydrate`, and a loader map in\n`apps/portfolio/src/main.ts`, a file that no longer exists.\n\nIt now lists every app with its port and every package, and describes the\nthree entries and the MountConfig / MountHandle contract, including that\n`config` is never a remote''s own data, the lesson from TOONHUB. A new\nFederated SSR section covers the vm strategy and NODE_OPTIONS, the plugin''s\nloopback-only plain-http SSR fetch behind the Docker topology, and the\nalias-aware reset. \"Adding a new project\" now matches the README, and the\nTurborepo notes cover strict env mode and .env as a global dependency. The\ndts warning is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"cfc36a55c5c1e67884f465e4c9d3a51e8f609515","url":