comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:08:15Z","email":"annminn104@gmail.com","name":"annminn104"},"message":"docs: spell out the Docker step for adding a project\n\nStep 5 of \"Adding a project\" still read as if a remote were a standalone\ncompose service with its own ports and gateway upstream. Since #82 every\nremote runs in the portfolio container''s network namespace, so a new one\nneeds `network_mode: service:portfolio`, its port published on the\nportfolio service, a Dockerfile ARG that defaults to the\n`http://localhost:<port>/remoteEntry.js` form, and an nginx upstream at\n`portfolio:<port>`. The step now says so.","tree":{"sha":"d5d7d4d4c5386409f2658afd6910f00ce48907b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/trees/d5d7d4d4c5386409f2658afd6910f00ce48907b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/annminn104/ncam.dev/git/commits/c29b7874623f0097844321988184c47c0dfc16e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76109800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annminn104","id":76109800,"login":"annminn104","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTA5ODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annminn104","user_view_type":"public"},"h