1T21:13:47Z","email":"43970944+PhillipT1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"PhillipT1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T21:13:47Z","email":"43970944+PhillipT1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"PhillipT1"},"message":"Expand slicer and simulation capabilities, add CLAUDE.md\n\nSlicer: adaptive layers, bridging, seam placement, support generation,\nvariable-width extrusion, presets, and a plugin system, backed by a new\npolygon-offset library (ADR-0011).\n\nSimulation: contact, dynamics, modal analysis, thermal, buckling,\nfatigue, plasticity, quadratic tet elements, adaptivity, and mass\nproperties.\n\nAdd CLAUDE.md with build/test commands and architecture guidance for\nfuture Claude Code sessions.","tree":{"sha":"2c80a06797e38d99423a8f8f6b1cec0e53e0ab35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tpt-solutions/tpt-vertex/git/trees/2c80a06797e38d99423a8f8f6b1cec0e53e0ab35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tpt-solutions/tpt-vertex/git/commits/2c4fd87c03613216fd5787ecface97f7712fdbc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43970944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhillipT1","id":43970944,"login":"PhillipT1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTcwOTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhillipT1/subscriptions","type":"User"