mmit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:19:51Z","email":"155443947+YoungSella@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YoungSella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:19:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(docker): expose NEXT_PUBLIC_* as build args (#643)\n\nBrowser-side env vars must be baked at Next.js build time. Adding ARG/ENV pairs in the build stage allows operators to configure the gateway URL via docker build --build-arg or compose.yml args without forking the image. Backward-compatible: defaults remain empty, behaviour unchanged when no build args are passed. Discovered via Project EIGHTBALL deployment with separate subdomains for gateway and dashboard.\n\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Rose <sella-media-hq@Mac.fritz.box>","tree":{"sha":"74a2ed4a5dc004ce5bee81542e09fd7bbfa6754e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/74a2ed4a5dc004ce5bee81542e09fd7bbfa6754e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/7233282f613e836058f4777040074a2e17bf223c","verification":{"payload":"tree 74a2ed4a5dc004ce5bee81542e09fd7bbfa6754e\nparent 980ae8449414990e03a4fb164684ed23ecbbbac7\nauthor YoungSella <155443947+YoungSella@users.noreply.github.com> 1778127591 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127591 +0700\n\nfeat(docker): expose NEXT_PUBLIC_* as build args (#643)\n\nBrowser-side env vars must be baked at Next.js build time. Adding ARG/ENV pairs in the build stage allows operators to configure the gateway URL via docker build --build-arg or compose.yml args without forking the image. Backward-compatible: defaults remain empty, behaviour unchanged when no build args are passed. Discovered via Project EIGHTBALL deployment with separate subdomains for gateway and dashboard.\n\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Rose <sella-media-hq@Mac.fritz.box>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BLnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9bkQAEhPim