han","id":20372033,"login":"mxihan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzcyMDMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mxihan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:11:17Z","email":"1181127934@qq.com","name":"HoshimiRIN"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:11:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve CSRF origin mismatch behind reverse proxies (#592)\n\nThe CSRF check only compared the Host header against the browser''s\nOrigin, causing false positives when reverse proxies (e.g. Nginx Proxy\nManager) rewrite or strip the Host header or its port.\n\n- Check all host candidates (x-forwarded-host, x-original-host, etc.)\n  instead of only the Host header\n- Add port-normalized comparison that strips default ports (80/443)\n  before matching","tree":{"sha":"b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348","verification":{"payload":"tree b59b748f7a49a6a756c967cbe2f8f098d3a51a25\nparent 3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780\nauthor HoshimiRIN <1181127934@qq.com> 1778127077 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127077 +0700\n\nfix: resolve CSRF origin mismatch behind reverse proxies (#592)\n\nThe CSRF check only compared the Host header against the browser''s\nOrigin, causing false positives when reverse proxies (e.g. Nginx Proxy\nManager) rewrite or strip the Host header or its port.\n\n- Check all host candidates (x-forwarded-host, x-original-host, etc.)\n  instead of only the Host header\n- Add port-normalized comparison that strips default ports (80/443)\n  before matching","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BDlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9wgQAJIGMoGoGuKZjic0i1f7t/SQ\njzWKsUOqeHJmkJ0qRvBJ5lVUyPrHnBdoO0RZjw6itVk2wXnOMjB2W6MXxA0fLWZw\nZHkpWDH0AT84rrv6fjX5f2Hgt4en4QFnBadC+72GpJ9abUhJYvKUe9mzSfzs2BS/\nTNvvh3XofZWj3+y68juTY6Rne4s5dqXMj8ch35f6/jXmhdNsmHuqDVE7JK0hiT5T\n0AXVBn/4cTICx3l2ezcuAezHeY7jTsoK5L+SwKxL/tKtw5a5nYTyqpQ/QwP/nCpZ\naG6x6qkkf1hQFXfKk5x3QXfQYU09MpYXUFDcle8aXhnth1UYghA57TeoDej7jFTH\nczUmakbLi+p57n/b2BrWsl40nLta6idVuXA3t61n7gB6yXDzvP5ex/JM8XGQHxQq\nkNxzJuojA+NNjLneybjiffmfIJ62Zfun9dcpTiSNTDLOTqnZ6r4dK88V5PTyueGC\nZo1UKjTYr1YUZEJZ3qHffbfibCnzq2kfpkQD4ztACz6rFA2KwAkXx2qYQfI8Ir2Q\nXsDn2swSZA3aY64yfYPwfj/oQ0zjIibUSxUlWm9fuesUbSxL/D5mBrZw+888tBUu\ny1NnNtDYPY5QEzy826HOMCIZ/oLvV28fVQFUVpb2kvtFFeZ3GSZfZipsVoqT+ioY\nkSx9uMLg1XN6wbKjmZCT\n=OXbp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T04:40:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commit/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348","node_id":"C_kwDOTbLPLdoAKDcxZjAxZmQzYjI2MmIwMDliMDJjODQ5ZGUxMTAwMGUxOWE3ZmQzNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commit/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","sha":"3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780"}],"sha":"71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/71f01fd3b262b009b02c849de11000e19a7fd348"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18496633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codingDr","id":18496633,"login":"codingDr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDk2NjMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingDr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:19Z","email":"18496633+codingDr@users.noreply.github.com","name":"codingDr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(agents): flatten gateway_config into buildAgentConfig overrides (#601)\n\nbuildAgentConfig expects a flat overrides shape, but the POST /api/agents\ntemplate branch was passing the nested gateway_config object with `as any`.\nThat silenced a real mismatch: overrides.model was {primary: \"<id>\"}, and\nthe function assigned the whole object to config.model.primary. Agents\ncreated from a template got a doubly-wrapped primary in the DB, crashing\nthe Models and Config tabs with \"Objects are not valid as a React child\n(found: object with keys {primary})\".\n\nExtract the leaf fields at the call site so the primary string survives\nand the other template overrides (identity, sandbox, subagents) actually\napply. Unit test locks in that overrides.model yields a string primary.\n\nFixes #599","tree":{"sha":"9a726f26bd75df5eed2ed2c28ae8951179445297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/9a726f26bd75df5eed2ed2c28ae8951179445297"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a726f26bd75df5eed2ed2c28ae8951179445297\nparent 549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15\nauthor codingDr <18496633+codingDr@users.noreply.github.com> 1778127019 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127019 +0700\n\nfix(agents): flatten gateway_config into buildAgentConfig overrides (#601)\n\nbuildAgentConfig expects a flat overrides shape, but the POST /api/agents\ntemplate branch was passing the nested gateway_config object with `as any`.\nThat silenced a real mismatch: overrides.model was {primary: \"<id>\"}, and\nthe function assigned the whole object to config.model.primary. Agents\ncreated from a template got a doubly-wrapped primary in the DB, crashing\nthe Models and Config tabs with \"Objects are not valid as a React child\n(found: object with keys {primary})\".\n\nExtract the leaf fields at the call site so the primary string survives\nand the other template overrides (identity, sandbox, subagents) actually\napply. Unit test locks in that overrides.model yields a string primary.\n\nFixes #599","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BCrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGe8QAKTuY3E6HeLVHwUfscb/5/Oy\nfT4xfhQjKkAhTD3S1dhySJdkuPDqROozH1mfWNWT1jfqoS8xJ0LzaVDsSKVOxvnV\naqdcg61YSgMMK/gNp7Neo1wMB5+zmdSYp/Inx0WpcinH3mguyugI6m1EAapZOvix\nz6ljRpCa9t4r2suRWDw+sGXy8dLlq/xk1Ywv2Sgv9Y6HNbf382hYCuCLsEfLxuSP\ntctws/43yJLzt8/j4UWKQ7NSGosSNMzK9fcOl3KdjHFoHmMvhHx7lrAhRNfrtDvB\nOD77RWDyV2M9EjY7LTOsXwZBzcgoaDSmfwc8z4XTZqym1d4a+kRFy64MwN0ZNopM\n2Ha/qD9zglKUsaNfbOWaiiStPztPp0AUaU45Mv0NP4kzWyht4dnOMGHf1NX0bLo2\nEP6XcUHGFL53EHg2dyMWOaCvcrMJPnegkM+BbHSI7n7/AZArj/td61ojkCuylyxG\nZM6dct0UHRMO8WYY557u94Tmlt2QFSGTUv4M+EEH7httWe7nPxd50wfW83TvQc7g\n+JbJmNiBH9PPlTFpB8O2rTjDemZi/vyA1Cb+zBk7hHYzCkIGjSu9EHYsHCYpmDUY\nN6yGEYmGjTTYzus81xw0FEZzUuvVxOL+sKR6WWg+K6a8T+eSjn+QF7mMDT1Zgl6G\nPZpLt8OA45mgoxuL+JDw\n=WDWC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T04:40:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commit/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","node_id":"C_kwDOTbLPLdoAKDNjOGVmNmU1ZDg5MDlmNzdiMTgxNzVlN2U3Y2ZlYzdjNmI0MGM3ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commit/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","sha":"549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15"}],"sha":"3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/3c8ef6e5d8909f77b18175e7e7cfec7c6b40c780"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7302758?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/galongin","id":7302758,"login":"galongin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDI3NTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/galongin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:13Z","email":"galongin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gal Longin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:10:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(validation): drop default values from updateTaskSchema (#621)\n\n`updateTaskSchema = createTaskSchema.partial()` makes every field\noptional but Zod''s `.partial()` keeps the underlying `.default(...)`,\nso a PUT body that omits e.g. `status` parses to `status: ''inbox''`,\n`tags: []`, `metadata: {}`. The route''s `if (field !== undefined)`\nguards then silently overwrite the stored row — a `PUT {title}` resets\nstatus to ''inbox'' and wipes tags/metadata.\n\nDefine `updateTaskSchema` explicitly with `.optional()` and no defaults.\nExtract the field validators into a shared `taskFields` map so the two\nschemas don''t drift. Defaults remain on `createTaskSchema` only.\n\nAdds regression tests covering empty body, single-field updates,\npass-through, and constraint enforcement.","tree":{"sha":"539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/549190576bcc08e4a7d2edc6e7839e5ca32efd15","verification":{"payload":"tree 539b260c959a374cffcce6bf59971283342f7baa\nparent d7ad94929c51017fc1d8d152886856f38aa7f6bd\nauthor Gal Longin <galongin@users.noreply.github.com> 1778127013 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778127013 +0700\n\nfix(validation): drop default values from updateTaskSchema (#621)\n\n`updateTaskSchema = createTaskSchema.partial()` makes every field\noptional but Zod''s `.partial()` keeps the underlying `.default(...)`,\nso a PUT body that omits e.g. `status` parses to `status: ''inbox''`,\n`tags: []`, `metadata: {}`. The route''s `if (field !== undefined)`\nguards then silently overwrite the stored row — a `PUT {title}` resets\nstatus to ''inbox'' and wipes tags/metadata.\n\nDefine `updateTaskSchema` explicitly with `.optional()` and no defaults.\nExtract the field validators into a shared `taskFields` map so the two\nschemas don''t drift. Defaults remain on `createTaskSchema` only.\n\nAdds regression tests covering empty body, single-field updates,\npass-through, and constraint enforcement.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/BClCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdg0QAHnn2X81zfQjEbxA4S2NIs8B\n0NlEtOEkFy5RgWQaKGozKsy5e7IYrOwtieEmoMp6Q85QzyqWGskI3aW8v8/0jFMr\nDcs77BpnnmfRrO5Y22kEHGFJe+yoaez10rMR6iSsV6guzjfVK+DYHyerzD9xSq7P\nB5zBFoViEBf0hRkCWfqyXwPA+Hgj1htTopmiMfEKubcapmffYx1cDtEneoif3ywS\nLMuCj/sPkMLw7sWLgAPR5e92wVAOOx3C9jTburqhLRhsYA1o1utSd8VDbTt044HN\nmIqpRgduv3sZIr6Em6mk6acUTxc/xZgqZnk8eXFP4bhl5HGG5a1OnqvqMZM1jw1F\nwT/9Gba5/LBxdXzkiAZDdEKMCusk8+7S9ypHWXMQmQADFavwq9CXLYWw6nDGHMdb\n723o5smCnnxt7uwykbaMwwGdDUncHbMl4CIScoc/KPw/zsAK/Jwyav1eHp6QbjaP\niv4+kDoTCK1b546QSnpuFZ+5SOAuN85Ad1UvMHwH4HcV11S22dUISyqSkdW0VbqL\nHa9l1r168H7CFwMeZTFKDKIKs1j9HsM/n5QvhBkSIVwsFO1glPNL8fvekaKiuw5+\nuTk4A3CqV951y7o9YFw4wh/ywj8bz8ilBcZZCUWVqKVsqEiClUrqPLpRLJuqY9UW\n5LXvp4XkSsxCsXrsV+Dt\n=VhNm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T04:40:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","s