JiwaniZakir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/503a289e935b044a6e759b22b905720fc89e513f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T08:36:12Z","email":"zakirjiw@gmail.com","name":"Zakir Jiwani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T08:36:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove incorrect Task Board placeholder screenshots from README (#595)\n\nFive feature sections (Memory, Skills, Cost Tracking, Security, Cron)\nreferenced doc images that were all identical Task Board screenshots\ninstead of the actual feature UIs. Remove the broken image references\nuntil correct screenshots are captured and committed.","tree":{"sha":"aae03722608e011265cf3c22fcd8400a604a9b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/aae03722608e011265cf3c22fcd8400a604a9b28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/503a289e935b044a6e759b22b905720fc89e513f","verification":{"payload":"tree aae03722608e011265cf3c22fcd8400a604a9b28\nparent 90a5615fc73dc03e35c1dc886bc6468013eb2275\nauthor Zakir Jiwani <zakirjiw@gmail.com> 1776674172 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776674172 +0700\n\nRemove incorrect Task Board placeholder screenshots from README (#595)\n\nFive feature sections (Memory, Skills, Cost Tracking, Security, Cron)\nreferenced doc images that were all identical Task Board screenshots\ninstead of the actual feature UIs. Remove the broken image references\nuntil correct screenshots are captured and committed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5eV8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJIYQAHHNZvcNlOXcoiASPNCamw7j\njSTZp4d6s3NmPooc1nGi3FEk7UJBsOroqbIcdp478fjKu5X5TE62Tu16vfA1L/BQ\nO4kWnPrbt++LSr15t8lpnFk4AAdrB+vNvwe+OzgUKMZBxl4e381VXgefUA3yc+62\nt4POOtfn/uA3R7omhvc4Nrele/uA5yp6zk7lAiJsX/UILSjnfxNdUbneoV7JsIgs\nSiOMzGsuatv1hlGw3eX8PdkdsKt7ZvV