/api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:45:48Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:45:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add runtime_type to agents + Hermes multi-agent profile provisioning (#550)\n\nSupport creating agents with an explicit runtime type (hermes, openclaw,\nclaude, codex, custom). When creating a Hermes agent, automatically\nprovisions a profile directory at ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ with\nconfig.yaml and SOUL.md — ready for Hermes multi-profile support.\n\n- DB migration 049: add runtime_type column to agents table\n- Validation: add runtime_type enum to createAgentSchema\n- Agent creation UI: runtime type dropdown (Auto-detect, Hermes, OpenClaw,\n  Claude Code, Codex CLI, Custom)\n- Agent card: shows runtime type badge\n- POST /api/agents: provisions ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ for hermes type\n- i18n keys for runtime type labels (10 locales)","tree":{"sha":"cdefa0f44cb4f1a5bb87b4169c5a168c2e8f8f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/cdefa0f44cb4f1a5bb87b4169c5a168c2e8f8f3d"},"url":"https