o51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/27f6a3d6c14849196a0b7f47794f4a4d484a0176"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:16Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free) (#473)\n\n* feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free)\n\nAdd a built-in task executor that calls the Anthropic Messages API\ndirectly when no OpenClaw gateway is available. This makes the full\ntask lifecycle work out of the box — tasks are actually executed by\nClaude, not just tracked as metadata.\n\nHow it works:\n- Scheduler checks: is a gateway registered? If yes, use gateway\n  dispatch (existing path). If no, check for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\n- When dispatching via direct API: builds prompt from task + agent\n  SOUL, selects model by complexity (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku), calls\n  Claude Messages API, stores response as resolution.\n- Aegis reviews also work via direct API — same fallback logic.\n- Token usage is recorded in the token_usage table.\n- After dispatch, task moves to ''review'' for Aegis quality check.\n\nSetup: add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... to .env.local\nNo gateway, no OpenClaw, no extra dependencies needed.\n\n* fix(tui): add missing ansi.blue color function","tree":{"sha":"c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957","verification":{"payload":"tree c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3\nparent 32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774176616 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774176616 +0700\n\nfeat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free) (#473)\n\n* feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free)\n\nAdd a built-in task executor that calls the Anthropic Messages API\ndirectly when no OpenClaw gateway is available. This makes the full\ntask lifecycle work out of the box — tasks are actually executed by\nClaude, not just tracked as metadata.\n\nHow it works:\n- Scheduler checks: is a gateway registered? If yes, use gateway\n  dispatch (existing path). If no, check for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\n- When dispatching via direct API: builds prompt from task + agent\n  SOUL, selects model by complexity (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku), calls\n  Claude Messages API, stores response as resolution.\n- Aegis reviews also work via direct API — same fallback logic.\n- Token usage is recorded in the token_usage table.\n- After dispatch, task moves to ''review'' for Aegis quality check.\n\nSetup: add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... to .env.local\nNo gateway, no OpenClaw, no extra dependencies needed.\n\n* fix(tui): add 