hat wraps\nthe Mission Control REST API as 35 MCP tools. Agents can add it with:\n\n  claude mcp add mission-control -- node scripts/mc-mcp-server.cjs\n\nTools cover the full agent workflow:\n- Agent lifecycle: list, get, heartbeat, wake, diagnostics, attribution\n- Memory & Soul: read/write/clear working memory, read/write SOUL,\n  list/retrieve SOUL templates\n- Tasks: CRUD, queue polling, broadcast, comments (list/add)\n- Sessions: list, control, continue, transcript\n- Connections: list, register\n- Tokens & Costs: stats, agent-costs, costs-by-agent\n- Skills: list, read content\n- Cron: list jobs\n- Status: health, dashboard, overview\n\nAuth uses the same profile system as the CLI (~/.mission-control/profiles/)\nor MC_URL/MC_API_KEY/MC_COOKIE environment variables.\n\nAlso adds `mc` and `mc:mcp` package.json scripts.","tree":{"sha":"fe48f8d87ce12b8de0ffc1a42d9c614fcf2c30f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/trees/fe48f8d87ce12b8de0ffc1a42d9c614fcf2c30f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/mission-control-dashboard/git/commits/59f7f0d7200e86fa0e62c34d0179f3daafe972d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/re