25Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T12:47:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tui): show only 24h token costs, not all-time session estimates (#478)\n\nThe cost bar was falling back to summing estimatedCost from ALL Claude\nCode sessions (all-time) when the token_usage table was empty, showing\ninflated costs like $3678. Now only uses the token_usage table which\nis already filtered to the 24h timeframe.","tree":{"sha":"8e40ee56a2e91c0509dd35182be82273adce300b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/Client_mission_control_dashboard/git/trees/8e40ee56a2e91c0509dd35182be82273adce300b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devSubho51347/Client_mission_control_dashboard/git/commits/648347cab75cd5232fafeba43bb723de62773b4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e40ee56a2e91c0509dd35182be82273adce300b\nparent 034865201e28cc097e00a95ed73a4248c5c259be\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774183645 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774183645 +0700\n\nfix(tui): show only 24h token costs, not all-time session estimates (#478)\n\nThe cost bar was falling back to summing estimatedCost from ALL Claude\nCode sessions (all-time) when the token_usage table was empty, showing\ninflated costs like $3678. Now only uses the token_usage table which\nis already filtered to the 24h timeframe.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv+TdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWOgQAFGCQLAbECpo98XkmcbE5S7D\nHD17nKhEq3pPqkzHet5KHJGJ+WP68IiXtMwoWi4tHh7bWToxD+MKCjp3zLO5GPr2\ngOagSX9RBWEDVIqXEpCNDLxeBi1+5qfNhQCSHs9JUrnlU/W0E4DLwOnqsikcpyKX\n+cbBaDXLkV2IIuxzMvfXiYNBAnNsntfowo8QGiANERt26L0xuBAfZIruuvcFNYBy\nT18vCyrmfXn1f7S6EYlxvftfUT1LPj1HhRPALp0tvfibvmk74bRhCecfaZx6uCZ2\nuFJXzvT+dWphdXot1gytHypHfuHgyHPTpsvV+Sn/vC908OEI53HyR0nLhhCeLpcG\np19PnStGkdJ/nKbgqNdKyOkvgtclO65/fMe+9FRi87Duu8C1je0NDcOVecn9U9uE\n9lN63idfZCm8/W48GOnuSTz3CVgXfY43r2sr