060b4deaa1bec1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commits/87a6f1f9efeb5338b137a18dc05aaef6b2205026/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:39:41Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T13:46:24Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(chore) Bump @openmrs/eslint-config to ^2.1.0\n\nThis bumps [`@openmrs/eslint-config`](https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-contrib-eslint-config) from 2.0.0 to 2.1.0, which relaxes consistent-type-imports in test and mock files so vitest mocks can type importOriginal() without a duplicate namespace type import.\n\nOur resource tests don''t need the type argument at all: spreading the untyped importOriginal() result typechecks fine. This also allows us to drop the `import type * as EsmFramework` imports, the\nimportOriginal<typeof EsmFramework>() type arguments, and the import/no-duplicates suppressions the duplicate imports required.","tree":{"sha":"cbb199e0726f0b42e1270f47802b01c542d78504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/git/trees/cbb199e0726f0b42e1270f47802b01c542d78504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/git/commits/87a6f1f9efeb5338b137a18dc05aaef6b2205026","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commit/87a6f1f9efeb5338b137a18dc05aaef6b2205026","node_id":"C_kwDOTbSimdoAKDg3YTZmMWY5ZWZlYjUzMzhiMTM3YTE4ZGMwNWFhZWY2YjIyMDUwMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commit/eebb333580e56a2c6b426c33c5e0672c808ce37c","sha":"eebb333580e56a2c6b426c33c5e0672c808ce37c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commits/eebb333580e56a2c6b426c33c5e0672c808ce37c"}],"sha":"87a6f1f9efeb5338b137a18dc05aaef6b2205026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commits/87a6f1f9efeb5338b137a18dc05aaef6b2205026"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/commits/eebb333580e56a2c6b426c33c5e0672c808ce37c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:10:01Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:10:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(chore) Adopt @openmrs/eslint-config and ESLint 9 (#3)\n\nLint config moves to a flat eslint.config.mjs that spreads\n@openmrs/eslint-config 2.0.0, replacing .eslintrc and .eslintignore. eslint\nmoves from 8.50 to ^9.39.0 and the --ext flag goes away, since flat config\nmakes it redundant.\n\nThis repo never adopted core''s list of relaxed rules, so the shared config\nis more lenient than what it enforces today. Comparing the effective rule\nsets before and after, thirteen rules would have been lost, so they are\nenforced again in an overlay: ban-ts-comment, no-explicit-any,\nno-unused-vars, triple-slash-reference, no-extra-boolean-cast,\nno-prototype-builtins, no-unsafe-optional-chaining, no-useless-escape,\nprefer-const, exhaustive-deps as a warning, and the three rules that\ntypescript-eslint v8 split ban-types into. None of them report anything\ntoday.\n\nThe ignores now cover dist and coverage. The old lint script scoped itself\nto src, so a repo-wide eslint run used to descend into build output. It\ndoes not any more, which makes eslint . meaningful.\n\nThe shared config adds import/no-duplicates, which reports the two\nframework imports in the resource tests. They cannot be merged: a namespace\ntype import will not combine with a value import, and consistent-type-imports\nforbids the typeof import(...) form, so each of the two import\nlines carries a disable comment recording why.\n\nFour unused dev dependencies go away with the plugins the shared config\nprovides: the typescript-eslint pair, eslint-plugin-jest-dom and\neslint-plugin-prettier were declared but never referenced by the old config.","tree":{"sha":"954882b5c22d9c6d5748701f62a13a1018407348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/git/trees/954882b5c22d9c6d5748701f62a13a1018407348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-audit-log-app/git/commits/eebb333580e56a2c6b426c33c5e0672c808ce37c","verification":{"payload":"tree 954882b5c22d9c6d5748701f62a13a1018407348\nparent 71ce1e5d80e1ceb4073ac614f87c7456ece9cf21\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1786464601 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786464601 +0530\n\n(chore) Adopt @openmrs/eslint-config and ESLint 9 (#3)\n\nLint config moves to a flat eslint.config.mjs that spreads\n@openmrs/eslint-config 2.0.0, replacing .eslintrc and .eslintignore. eslint\nmoves from 8.50 to ^9.39.0 and the --ext flag goes away, since flat config\nmakes it redundant.\n\nThis repo never adopted core''s list of relaxed rules, so the shared config\nis more lenient than what it enforces today. Comparing the effective rule\nsets before and after, thirteen rules would have been lost, so they are\nenforced again in an overlay: ban-ts-comment, no-explicit-any,\nno-unused-vars, triple-slash-reference, no-extra-boolean-cast,\nno-prototype-builtins, no-unsafe-optional-chaining, no-useless-escape,\nprefer-const, exhaustive-deps as a warning, and the three rules that\ntypescript-eslint v8 split ban-types into. None of them report anything\ntoday.\n\nThe ignores now cover dist and coverage. The old lint script scoped itself\nto src, so a repo-wide eslint run used to descend into build output. It\ndoes not any more, which makes eslint . meaningful.\n\nThe shared config adds import/no-duplicates, which reports the two\nframework imports in the resource tests. They cannot be merged: a namespace\ntype import will not combine with a value import, and consistent-type-imports\nforbids the typeof import(...) form, so each of the two import\nlines carries a disable comment recording why.\n\nFour unused dev dependencies go away with the plugins the shared config\nprovides: the typescript-eslint pair, eslint-plugin-jest-dom and\neslint-plugin-prettier were declared but never referenced by the old config.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqe0lZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP/8QABLKSM+xTO6+jab8ovu4gJbn\nY/Njf4mvNJxIg1q60G9/Xgb0eH9++arVOmRrXzkXAY5JG7nQd6D3uW9TktdXSXxU\nxMmp9o16VwsvN3XmvHqH05YJytztyNCiQpnOvQi01HMonvzTcHNbb3QSv3LecGqO\nGHOKiIf3pdWL0DaSSEig0YyLso4l2FMG+a5SG1LACCc53mZKjrscwQq5/HOeatCA\nHzc2VWF4mI+1wVRwST6zFasEFDILDHUJRqX3iGRCWCMDZ4V1Rl7I75ZXmvOeUY9Y\n+Tdn9aMIon/azL5g/egTX7oOW4iHJ6/TgO5o2EQ+ZkhqKUfl+QN9iDPhG2ArKpmD\ndLJPk9XCJXWxv41P3uVsc7TOQ1Rqp2ToxN/6COZG5/v7baFXUQYcn5maW9TnFSou\n/ai1M0zthB8djxPYl+quj+t39D2bBhEKpC1gCT19HOK6q0uUL8EJQxu0Sc9d94k7\nhlTciYLbrpcByENXpezTY8Wg0njH+fCxHfnMooP3IAlrwATC5suKuY5i8jjt/s1g\nRbDIokL7Lu6hzFB+SM9HY7FgLyHcanzPW6dDrjfi20wShkkeCj3N66gwb8zOIMIP\nWLOjzaiV99g21DJT/elO8IENMo4tytdXJU/lCfHVmzo83m6ZQOWDNcmaKtBW741D\nlnDrMaL2C