users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepu0/whatstack/commits/a45a63f5293b1bc1d696f3f41db7e29ea0ed2f71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:47:58Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T08:47:58Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"message":"fix(detect): harden probe, anchor URL rules, code-only inline rules, validated versions\n\n- MAIN-world probe: one try per detector, safe reads, clipped strings, never\n  String() page objects; rejects DOM-clobbered globals (Node/HTMLCollection)\n  and requires library shape (axios.get, bootstrap.Modal, gtag(), ...)\n- window.next is a version hint only (weight 1); Next.js is promoted to high\n  only with strong proof. Fixes ''Next.js v1.0.0-beta.9'' on linear.app and\n  <a id=\"next\"> producing Next.js + React\n- script/css rules match host+path with the query stripped (opt-in\n  matchQuery for ?dpl=); unanchored vendor words anchored to hosts/packages\n- inline rules are code-shaped; content script samples executable scripts\n  only (no JSON/ld+json data islands)\n- Tailwind: no double count; Tailwind-only syntax => medium, --tw-* vars =>\n  high, generic utility soup => low (fixes Tailwind MEDIUM on getbootstrap.com)\n- versions: package-boundary regexes, per-tech major ranges, build metadata\n  dropped (fixes remix->react, @tanstack/react-router->react-router,\n  react-bootstrap->bootstrap, preact->react, pagination cursor->next)\n- correct globals: TURBOPACK, __sveltekit_<hash>, __svelte.v, webpackJsonp,\n  _reactListening, el.__vue__; _ngcontent attribute scan now works\n- new: AngularJS, Astro, Gatsby, Qwik, Preact, Lit, Polymer, Ember, Alpine.js,\n  htmx, WordPress, Shopify, Webflow, Framer, PostHog, Plausible, Fathom,\n  Amplitude (new ''CMS / Site builder'' category)\n- build tools seen only in third-party scripts, or conflicting with a\n  meta-framework''s bundler, are demoted to low\n- exports: headline cap, Markdown escaping, JSON schemaVersion, report\n  evidence without query strings","tree":{"sha":"68f301256a7225ccef35a6ce15ed606c63dc2e99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepu0/whatstack/git/trees/68f301256a7225ccef35a6ce15ed606c63dc2e99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepu0/whatstack/git/commits/a45a63f5293b1bc1d696f3f41db7e29ea0ed2f71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/rep