"","html_url":"https://github.com/francescomurador","id":139330701,"login":"francescomurador","node_id":"U_kgDOCE4EjQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francescomurador","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frax93/core-react-library/commits/09cc670419c6e844d8e07d52a47e62b1ac7aef58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:08:55Z","email":"francesco.murador@sistinf.it","name":"Francesco Murador"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:19:59Z","email":"francesco.murador@sistinf.it","name":"Francesco Murador"},"message":"Prepare library for open-source publication (v0.2.0)\n\nLicensing & packaging:\n- Replace contradictory LICENSE with proper MIT text\n- Fix dual-package: emit CJS as .cjs, add exports map, engines, keywords\n- Generate dist/package.json from root package.json (single source of truth)\n\nRemove project-specific coupling (breaking):\n- Make AuthData/useUserProfile generic; drop proprietary user schema\n- StyleLoaderService.loadStyles(baseUrl) instead of REACT_APP_MFSHARED_REMOTE_URL\n- useNavbarHeight(elementId, eventName?) instead of hardcoded navigation-menu\n- Configurable GraphQL endpoint (default /graphql)\n\nRuntime fixes:\n- Lazy window/ResizeObserver access (no crash on Node/SSR import)\n- Lazy process.env access (no \"process is not defined\" in browser)\n- usePromises.clearPendingPromises cancels via .cancel() instead of .then()\n\nTesting & docs:\n- Add Vitest suite (58 tests across utils, hooks, HTTP layer, components)\n- Rewrite README in English with working examples; add CONTRIBUTING & CHANGELOG\n- Remove out-of-scope useBtcRate hook","tree":{"sha":"3d3af1df9c2b8b42b6e2268210f1f1ce9e50e384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frax93/core-react-library/git/trees/3d3af1df9c2b8b42b6e2268210f1f1ce9e50e384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frax93/core-react-library/git/commits/09cc670419c6e844d8e07d52a47e62b1ac7aef58","verification":{"payload":"tree 3d3af1df9c2b8b42b6e2268210f1f1ce9e50e384\nparent ca62bc4cc097a0e6fac3bcb59343014d7eb1d3fe\nauthor Francesco Murador <francesco.murador@sistinf.it> 1784290135 +0200\ncommitter Francesco Murador <francesco.murador@sistinf.it> 1784290799 +0200\n\nPrepare library for open-source publication (v0.2.0)\n\nLicensing & packaging:\n- Replace contradictory LICENSE with proper MIT text\n- Fix dual-package: emit CJS as .cjs, add exports map, engines, keywords\n- Generate dist/package.json from root package.json (single source of truth)\n\nRemove project-specific coupling (breaking):\n- Make AuthData/useUserProfile generic; drop proprietary user schema\n- StyleLoaderService.loadStyles(baseUrl) instead of REACT_APP_MFSHARED_REMOTE_URL\n- useNavbarHeight(elementId, eventName?) instead of hardcoded navigation-menu\n- Configurable GraphQL endpoint (default /graphql)\n\nRuntime fixes:\n- Lazy window/ResizeObserver access (no crash on Node/SSR import)\n- Lazy process.env access (no \"process is not defined\" in browser)\n- usePromises.clearPendingPromises cancels via .cancel() instead of .then()\n\nTesting & docs:\n- Add Vitest suite (58 tests across utils, hooks, HTTP layer, components)\n- Rewrite README in English with working examples; add CONTRIBUTING & CHANGELOG\n- Remove out-of-scope useBtcRate hook\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgZDiYqg6SmLhAbKQCOYdSvoRKIt\nZAiFRQ1qKh0R0kbjkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGKvVuIYBekZQzcDOMhpD2LJ9/khTjA3ZSjI2ezCakOZG1TFWuyK0oN+x7Gdoz0f3s\n+XLNgKqr/J1J