,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:12:58Z","email":"francesco.murador@sistinf.it","name":"Francesco Murador"},"message":"Initial public release: open-source Angular shared library (v0.1.0)\n\nAngular 19 library for Module Federation micro-frontends: dynamic remote loaders,\na typed HTTP layer with caching, authorization utilities and Bootstrap Italia UI\nmodels.\n\n- MIT licensed; package published as @frank.md93/core-angular-library from dist/\n- Generic auth/authorization contracts (AuthData<TUser>, AuthUser.authorizations)\n- Generic AppConfig / Header / Footer models (no application-specific fields)\n- Karma + Jasmine test suite (ChromeHeadless in CI)\n- CI, npm publish on tag, CodeQL, Dependabot, PR/issue templates, SECURITY.md","tree":{"sha":"8e8ede009638b651b3d364982be082c65aad4dac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frax93/core-angular-library/git/trees/8e8ede009638b651b3d364982be082c65aad4dac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frax93/core-angular-library/git/commits/89c54a5e9290135b078db185346e65b01cf5c937","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e8ede009638b651b3d364982be082c65aad4dac\nauthor Francesco Murador <francesco.murador@sistinf.it> 1784542378 +0200\ncommitter Francesco Murador <francesco.murador@sistinf.it> 1784542378 +0200\n\nInitial public release: open-source Angular shared library (v0.1.0)\n\nAngular 19 library for Module Federation micro-frontends: dynamic remote loaders,\na typed HTTP layer with caching, authorization utilities and Bootstrap Italia UI\nmodels.\n\n- MIT licensed; package published as @frank.md93/core-angular-library from dist/\n- Generic auth/authorization contracts (AuthData<TUser>, AuthUser.authorizations)\n- Generic AppConfig / Header / Footer models (no application-specific fields)\n- Karma + Jasmine test suite (ChromeHeadless in CI)\n- CI, npm publish on tag, CodeQL, Dependabot, PR/issue templates, SECURITY.md\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3