":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/ba879e5539317901fa0858c30dfcdbc790cfb099/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T00:40:05Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T00:40:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Phase 10 — Testing, Polish & Documentation (#121)\n\n* feat: Phase 10 — Testing, Polish & Documentation\n\n- Create integration test plan (docs/development/TESTING.md) with 15\n  manual test scenarios covering full lifecycle, RBAC, error handling,\n  UI state transitions, cross-page navigation, and BFF resilience\n- Replace Spinner loading states with PatternFly Skeleton components\n  on InstanceManagementPage (card-shaped skeleton) and\n  EmbeddedDashboardsPage (gallery skeleton for dashboards, block\n  skeleton for status/embed loading)\n- Add EmbedErrorBoundary component wrapping SupersetDashboardEmbed\n  to catch rendering errors with recovery UI\n- Improve accessibility: aria-live on status section, aria-label on\n  dashboard gallery, RBAC list, and embed container region\n- Update AGENTS.md: replace all \"Planned\"/\"seed\" sections with\n  accurate descriptions of implemented pages, hooks, BFF routes,\n  and dependencies\n- Update README.md and docs with testing documentation references\n- Fix outdated \"planned BFF endpoints\" reference in BFF_PATTERN.md\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add key prop to EmbedErrorBoundary for dashboard navigation reset\n\nWhen navigating between dashboards, the error boundary now resets\nautomatically via React''s key-based remounting, preventing stale\nerror state from persisting across different embedded dashboards.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(a11y): narrow aria-live region to status text in InstanceManagementPage (#127)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: extract dashboard skeleton placeholder count to constant (#128)\n\n* refactor: extract dashboard skeleton placeholder count to constant\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove unnecessary JSDoc comment from skeleton count constant\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: clarify guest token TTL source in TESTING.md T-024 (#129)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(security): add safety comment to error boundary rendering (#130)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(a11y): add screenreaderText to dashboard list loading skeletons (#131)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"960e902565c1be4b987284