stale\nerror state from persisting across different embedded dashboards.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(a11y): narrow aria-live region to status text in InstanceManagementPage (#127)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: extract dashboard skeleton placeholder count to constant (#128)\n\n* refactor: extract dashboard skeleton placeholder count to constant\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove unnecessary JSDoc comment from skeleton count constant\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: clarify guest token TTL source in TESTING.md T-024 (#129)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(security): add safety comment to error boundary rendering (#130)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(a11y): add screenreaderText to dashboard list loading skeletons (#131)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXBzlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArVEQAGt4DpXFv++bm8eH1MS//Zqy\nVT5BtWZdXZekkclIOprDlnzeICJSWItKQS4uU4PeDZjyOPl0jzFH6I1mt2jZuq/r\nnTg5nrcRBIlByhcRagDav5VYEXq0FF7fg9gwCJVlLfd5y8/JGNgcsquXw6QCHIz2\n