 defense-in-depth path validation in helmRenderer: chartDir\n  must be under chart/charts/ OR match the SUPERSET_CHART_DIR env var,\n  AND contain a Chart.yaml\n- Add get and update verbs to RBAC in plugin.yaml and deployment docs\n  (needed by applyResource''s PUT on 409 and status checks)\n- Add .dockerignore to reduce build context size\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bff): add SUPERSET_CHART_DIR env var positive path coverage (#118)\n\nCloses #115\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bff): document DEFAULT_CHART_DIR load-time capture behavior (#119)\n\n* fix(bff): document DEFAULT_CHART_DIR load-time capture behavior\n\nCloses #116\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bff): convert DEFAULT_CHART_DIR to getter to prevent env var divergence\n\nCloses #116\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(bff): add test for Chart.yaml existence check in helmRenderer (#120)\n\nCloses #117\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca0d1276adce7979ad5059c824e2d94380810c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/ca0d1276adce7979ad5059c824e2d94380810c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/ac7a54999c3b87b848b7b15b8d9a20128db60c5a","verification":{"p