community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/d99104d49ab78055e17a203aa0d89db2b6dd4390"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/e527e199f7360a1ad88e511327156d43e5d8860c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:07:38Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:07:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dashboards): show not-running state instead of infinite spinner (#110)\n\nWhen navigating directly to an embedded dashboard URL while Superset is\nnot running, the status loads but status.url is undefined, making\nsupersetDomain falsy. This caused the combined `statusLoading || !supersetDomain`\nguard to keep showing a spinner forever with no way to escape.\n\nSplit the guard into two separate checks: one for the loading state (shows\nspinner) and one for the not-running/no-domain state (shows NotRunningState\nwith a link to Instance Management). Adds four new tests covering these\ncases in the Embed view.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14335c460937c8674602148bf76374ace48df5b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/14335c460937c8674602148bf76374ace48df5b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/e527e199f7360a1ad88e511327156d43e5d8860c","verification":{"payload":"tree 14335c460937c8674602148bf76374ace48df5b5\nparent b4b5abb7a92b186dbd6048136ec9575028b98837\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784401658 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784401658 -0400\n\nfix(dashboards): show not-running state instead of infinite spinner (#110)\n\nWhen navigating directly to an embedded dashboard URL while Superset is\nnot running, the status loads but status.url is undefined, making\nsupersetDomain falsy. This caused the combined `statusLoading || !supersetDomain`\nguard to keep showing a spinner forever with no way to escape.\n\nSplit the guard into two separate checks: one for the loading state (shows\nspinner) and one for the not-running/no-domain state (shows NotRunningState\nwith a link to Instance Management). Adds four new tests covering these\ncases in the Embed view.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW876CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArtUQAEZGcqW4yeqxUUdvnpooxksa\nnXTlSRbKphTLYKTB15CWF0fUMUFDukURBqzQO/bIfW6pT7OoJRQhuWlHKo2q8mBE\n+w99vgmxFv42tRnfyR4hGcmtbONR+fYe1xwSoqERQEGeBT6e7Gzz2bXTjt3kVqtj\nzWXzC+Sw4hxm0GV1Pyfi9PK05iFT0SLl2ab3sc8SdPcCM2uZrun8RutQDG/2wEU8\nL3Kq3mDnp21kDMLazlXsZjBSs1ajxjaws+/we1i1H4irGVBQ6TMcxOTkIiLqZmYM\nVGj06vOFNGuszN8hXnuI3ccxmPjcFLOF833dpPfs/KBJzraKyfV2x7FUhCxt8x0n\nm8rQ0T3LiieCLR1WT19iQLx740tjfhK1p2uEOvrDb1wTj/UzdpC/0bXoPUc64TTH\nwRvqvFdJ30Kc0luVCbOLeGtros7j