ar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/b4b5abb7a92b186dbd6048136ec9575028b98837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:07:36Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:07:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(embed): add error handling for embedDashboard SDK failures (#109)\n\nAdd `.catch()` to the embedDashboard promise so SDK failures (network\nerrors, CORS issues, invalid domain) are caught and surfaced as a\nPatternFly danger Alert instead of triggering an unhandled promise\nrejection. The error state is cleared whenever the embedding deps\nchange, and the container div remains mounted at all times so the ref\nstays valid across error/recovery cycles.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2bac6b280815390b4cc89cb9b667ebb64a84059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/f2bac6b280815390b4cc89cb9b667ebb64a84059"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/b4b5abb7a92b186dbd6048136ec9575028b98837","verification":{"payload":"tree f2bac6b280815390b4cc89cb9b667ebb64a84059\nparent a2c6d2b1801901865459b21a8c47448d1007fddd\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784401656 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784401656 -0400\n\nfix(embed): add error handling for embedDashboard SDK failures (#109)\n\nAdd `.catch()` to the embedDashboard promise so SDK failures (network\nerrors, CORS issues, invalid domain) are caught and surfaced as a\nPatternFly danger Alert instead of triggering an unhandled promise\nrejection. The error state is cleared whenever the embedding deps\nchange, and the container div remains mounted at all times so the ref\nstays valid across error/recovery cycles.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW874CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKXUQAGST5vuqxeLuYJqNH0JLxHuW\nICe/npFv1TUxtqxjmQxjyDCz6OVTv1FwKlOKPTHz34EFsuH2q4WNx2T2HV4SD9tV\nEn8QhrucrIWRLiV59OrvEx3NCZjWU3fKTMjUkgxOuVgwi/9zWxiM8jofMEfDvy3b\niucyKJctfncjUotP0esxdbRtLhrDwjmg4mQtcIiO+UfwFTrshV7N+RANsAmD0EJt\ni1HiVR9CNik4WpQGjLYQ6lc9k6Q6MOIZ8FBenNLLjeRheErFbjth2nCcl+FgHXCT\nSxxps8qDK9l5Q2G2lhXPaQtmR8R9IXUUIUsKrGlSO/RU2eeL6MclZkjEqspUBXkr\nJY0YduC9whnpx7Z6Yfp0NZ0wKs3vXAv/wLCRcRfRfvh0sCBrztIGMRdgF2e/n8IU\noG/BI1WHB14tX0sbk1bF5FKNfiU9q66NXKiuGn7OFB7dRGFkduqH6eRiAY/aFMDJ\nHEqt/4uPFEEoyNT0XRvg+nMRU1+7wLkh91XIdkTNxDjw1BlsVseYr0F20TYhrMUJ\nowUhz9r7X4BxzQKKwojqm7LhtKSYd8eCmahiuiK5+cQ/i9Feb6Jt5GKZchxazkCg\nPA9VSAnPVdbtuyhDNa4zugry4ta3ZXK2npn5L4K+0HUPu3l6zb6rNobF3MzYijol\nSEDYlDinoy8GyaIKJwy0\n=25xe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T19:07:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1