ou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/a2c6d2b1801901865459b21a8c47448d1007fddd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:23:13Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:23:13Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"fix: address review findings (round 1)\n\n- Fix race condition in SupersetDashboardEmbed: track cancelled flag\n  so SDK unmount is called even if promise resolves after component\n  unmounts\n- Replace innerHTML with replaceChildren() for safer DOM cleanup\n- Add supersetDomain guard in embed view to show spinner until\n  Superset URL is available (prevents broken iframe on direct nav)\n- Extract inline styles to CSS classes (SupersetDashboardEmbed.css)\n- Fix setLoading(false) in useSupersetDashboards to not run after\n  abort\n- Remove isSelectable/isClickable from Card, disable button for\n  non-embeddable dashboards\n- Validate guestToken response shape in useSupersetGuestToken\n- Improve embed cleanup test to verify unmount is actually called\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75e604c7c0be7a21ac76da85cdc8e5bafbbe73b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/75e604c7c0be7a21ac76da85cdc8e5bafbbe73b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-