erset/git/trees/63e6e47d7cf5bfd18a159f23f977bfbae7fb78a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/30bc5c30daa4e9ca1147f858fbd2bc86393d5444","verification":{"payload":"tree 63e6e47d7cf5bfd18a159f23f977bfbae7fb78a7\nparent 116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784387646 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784387646 -0400\n\nperf(bff): parallelize getAdminCredentials and getUserInfo in guest-token route (#86)\n\nRun both independent K8s calls concurrently via Promise.allSettled to\nreduce latency in the guest-token endpoint.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW5g+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgucQAC/OqVQhIKHl6tq9mJdeFGnU\nZBK7JirQxsXfT04QHem+bDr7gcwZOWdOj1eo6YWUUvA+xvUaDiB5T0MqqvddxWeO\nW7ZeIIPzZ7LisECslrF4dZW/tHjjHyZ+r1NLFk8QYNlp4qU67IMoE/F2sr/fnnmr\nnQ5k/qBDpVpl8WR08tOpkktdYdEKuWxWx59jB8m5bmLgbVtTJGE+JRyn1yBd7tgo\nbthxNbniYS4F3lCrfSkX+TnNCjFpwNnhSSbEl0GWtzqEur8zK/X0ifiI8DY819C3\nUAW/NwI5JGRh+ZQW2Pin4JFzDLf93DSv2hGLtGrOvxq/lOTCHi2TAO3KflYwEi7e\nLOH+tVTjPpHMHhNFWR8gHkoH3PBG5nKdbSUel6DDAXlg/3AtRtYTOHxbhfPlELTs\nFLoOvwz3tDwqfS70fKEjthURdsuzlT97TQdi2KdF0pGSKDeN6rrk+c0ElmEBNhMe\nN5axVb864VGf5OlFlY30061C+y6yfXaF7MFo020XcMz/7+z9SXZfdfgN7gjrPFdv\nJJYl5+s47vRuZEqh0n+FXfjlJbo05m5dd7r7sGo8y3sqlQCYwc3cwUi9kaVBMZjX\nOg0Ecvyc5TD1HYOuttJMrxCd6vfK/DAwz84HlnQ7h77v+GBXWND/ze6QhLeEFNFS\nsvY3Y4zSS2IYgUu050/R\n=tlsS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T15:14:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap