"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:09:29Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:09:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(bff): surface user-identity errors in guest-token route (#85)\n\nCatch K8sApiError from getUserInfo specifically and return the upstream\nstatus code with a descriptive \"Unable to resolve user identity\" message,\nrather than falling through to the generic 500 handler. This makes it\neasier to distinguish identity-resolution failures (e.g. 403 when the\nuser''s token lacks permission to call the OpenShift User API) from\nunrelated server errors.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"feb91d7de2b9a1e4961887a25976d25faa39d5f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/feb91d7de2b9a1e4961887a25976d25faa39d5f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46","verification":{"payload":"tree feb91d7de2b9a1e4961887a25976d25faa39d5f9\nparent 546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784387369 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784387369 -0400\n\nfeat(bff): surface user-identity errors in guest-token route (#85)\n\nCatch K8sApiError from getUserInfo specifically and return the upstream\nstatus code with a descriptive \"Unable to resolve user identity\" message,\nrather than falling through to the generic 500 handler. This makes it\neasier to distinguish identity-resolution failures (e.g. 403 when the\nuser''s token lacks permission to call the OpenShift User API) from\nunrelated server errors.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW5cpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArPYQAKmr45tlcU/gWRmEwe6UfHqg\nRyd45vpX1uo2pWmdbvNvYpDp1z+O5ZGvtegTKABsfT478pAoj2ylpGEgTnQCd8sY\n4ThvCA8lyznP+vb3kJbZ0TxgjKURL9VtqIX37rVWOEIyrKtxUnLh050mnLp5T7DG\nIPBdKQak4OMUUrQyqXz3hOSttvsjl3KjOSOuFxaZu9EIHpXNlaCQhVXjWDaUdmTS\nuWjCsFXYYUgqMNW4eEuDuWr9I3sabmgWjHwdZ2aHAbI5vlAzKeBELeUcbgt7d/hr\ne4+sqSj5QF4UbuSOcM0FkYS+uBHV/2q43AflqXDEcY6qjA/TmA5sgjKMWs4SW3ZV\ncef9MGQ9rYeesuYzIaftdMUPjbgZHibpAGXVPvVn0n9bhdLM47G+KZZ7gsCax4EH\nK0NVkUJRYOpfQ69UX+PnthNVVXgeXbNn9zXAZnLFjRpj3gIbtmT+VL1zW0snavT3\n7OdYcBku2EZBQ0BotROE2ndhV+ody+VC+Pzmfkq1hBVhOD4luOyfS8P9nYaRZtQh\nJ4OmAccd5Iw9OzEA/cLzJ3aah/ae21VbQj8N0KGCKraatRgH+Ftnm/Zog5VmJcB2\n/EugoaXy5+ro6wbp/n2osCAh7N2Mt5IQAEFMpPxXRLrylbCzMCVbCHs4fy0W8Rh9\nP2WzrcWS6lwZS3Fp4J7h\n=X+d/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T15:09:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46","node_id":"C_kwDOTbpVO9oAKDExNmY5OGMxYmQ5NTk2OTNjZjI2NTQ3ZWUxMDc4ODY5ZjY1ZDdmNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa","sha":"546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa"}],"sha":"116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/116f98c1bd959693cf26547ee1078869f65d7f46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:05:59Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:05:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(bff): remove unused getSupersetUrl export (#83)\n\n* chore(bff): remove unused getSupersetUrl export\n\nRemove the `export` keyword from `getSupersetUrl` in secretReader.ts so\nit is no longer part of the module''s public API. Refactor\n`getAdminCredentials` to call the internal helper instead of duplicating\nthe Route-then-service URL resolution inline. Add a JSDoc-style comment\ndocumenting the function''s purpose and its reservation for future\ncredential-free URL lookups (e.g. a lightweight status endpoint).\n\nRemove the now-redundant `getSupersetUrl` describe block and its import\nfrom the test file; URL resolution behaviour continues to be covered\nindirectly through the `getAdminCredentials` tests.\n\nCloses #78\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bff): address review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6433a81e3170a13385e7b644d7912a931422484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/d6433a81e3170a13385e7b644d7912a931422484"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/546d68e5d2e3a0135073e8d7e6fa98f6a39359aa","verification":{"payload":"tree d6433a81e3170a13385e7b644d7912a931422484\nparent c11533d8ac8822d2732eeae6c3e9a65cf848422c\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784387159 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784387159 -0400\n\nchore(bff): remove unused getSupersetUrl export (#83)\n\n* chore(bff): remove unused getSupersetUrl export\n\nRemove the `export` keyword from `getSupersetUrl` in secretReader.ts so\nit is no longer part of the module''s public API. Refactor\n`getAdminCredentials` to call the internal helper instead of duplicating\nthe Route-then-service URL resolution inline. Add a JSDoc-style comment\ndocumenting the function''s purpose and its reservation for future\ncredential-free URL lookups (e.g. a lightweight status endpoint).\n\nRemove the now-redundant `getSupersetUrl` describe block and its import\nfrom the test file; URL resolution behaviour continues to be covered\nindirectly through the `getAdminCredentials` tests.\n\nCloses #78\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(bff): address review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW5ZYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc9sQAGl4FrgDkDLASgUOvkHwOFuB\nPFITl1S1C2x+wcZ7Ucoc71X3tnT814NwvMC2YzbzZA1rwlWfVLQXedkgNy+DH2Bl\n18fGb/cQOJkOPVDooQwEnBgCOTdjj2iUcuzzzKThj6HTFT5+qSY9XHkb6Aoryess\n+oZixblel6PRLjgY0OBeIr+igb99R5owEp4i/DJQn+pNVihMI9hrsQTNRVa+CNAr\nHVvaOpo2sNVO3Ffq2iO26OeLiCCy+NgSAvKQTtB38ljEvkTWrrNSt7WGQ+8c7IK8\nBV7oKObYWGLj7NH01UeRn8tuzCu9emZMCkc5Hn/7ijc7hnkPiLxiLCpazJIu4ZHJ\n78XynAw1PWe+NZ5ZKgPvV1KX0ekCOOf1wS0z9pZIfiidzybtwbrXQN/Gi6PT4gAL\nDtjRT/YCFnsQ3nDfZfupGH5ZFoWUVGD8JOlkpOysys2MwFCmOkxL8tQNMqY76bkR\nVjstzY+XKgNmifUEoDxlLIMtC7TPS6OOCpzz/JDx8onIVfhXCAGLPBo/yiQgpv+o\nqBcYlDxH8d4dSTMW91IruUTwHEw3w4KdXnR/MZR+IviFhmFbhzQ5ZRRqqwbLwmNW\nz+bwdUWjPkOVvtbLauPkzK8zkKipawDjOyo5Yx9C/rKhM06sHuekStV1uwjVGp1P\nftkH9IStW2q8ZQUU6edI\n=OhEY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T15:06:00Z"}},"commit