785f005b4f6e0ff40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/1b3a6debf2daff820a69b1cdf49740cb13b0c545","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bae32d259e1cad2dadf638785f005b4f6e0ff40\nparent 7877e7ee86d7ea1e7c86e8fe7bec627e05eac89d\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784381892 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784381892 -0400\n\nchore(bff): extract shared test helpers from route tests (#75)\n\nExtract createTestApp, createTestAppNoToken, and testRequest into\nbff/src/__tests__/helpers/testServer.ts and update all three route\ntest files to import from the shared helper instead of defining their\nown copies. Replace the inline K8sApiError class definition in each\njest.mock() factory with jest.requireActual so the real class is reused.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW4HECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeEUQALD1/D42v1vYmDlOr/VU3gqZ\nRThF4Wa7cqlPmgTKB6jhb7TqhyIZaKouOjNXPWIA6rO4vgzxUjqEuM0XzzU0PuPH\nPXo4DB0IObf7ZMhDIFLxg58u2xcrVFhHDCd9U6yQ1AwWP93w4JfZ0lEVNIqMQBO4\nQ7hTtCzzPaXKWf2TBC4cCJh1loYKwpuJbAmzKqNfawVWFmVDNyxgd9lv3fVV5jXj\np1Vp6aOpKNYBdfrHazakrOe3scDd0CLnN4e+4WAEDF0vRNaOB1WvfFjbc7NMA9tl\n+IF35bno5kDDtSailjKtUf9+dNJSP1ITQiX6GH3Jx7EDun+q6EI5d/uAbfvRjC1E\nstMwFQBGfADyxx2yk7HCqIBXcDdZ8ZmDU/71/eyGEpChlUueUllbuiSIXkjvpJNn\nbaX3DSfAizYei4MeOSjCSerbxkhuqN9rt+ArIi2quGUAM6vMr3l9gQKvZobC/tXq\nYqTWqVfCRebZhr1S5dCn+crg13ul9IzWukHJdhUm6PsDN6Pi3zqfCqehREhOf0dG\n45Cs0hIa8J5rAYaESb1UlGoEiaGJPxFk+OZYaITZUBwJO4Lj7G27by9ZPMkIGoII\nAVGZI7m6jYiA+sJGWjaXFd4e55zgEk2zQvfkHJ7VZVh6JnkAd6y4vd0oVYZFxM9h\nHXr9xm4LDJuXBbBo5ae7\n=Jepn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T13:38:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy