vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/d64e656233f275bb67232a0adb5cc2334ca019b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:24:15Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:24:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(bff): parallelize teardown resource listing and deletion (#73)\n\nFan out all resource-kind listings via Promise.allSettled (read-only,\nsafe to run concurrently), then delete matching resources within each\nkind in parallel (independent operations). Error accumulation pattern\nis preserved: list failures and per-resource delete failures are\ncollected and returned in the errors array; 404s are still silently\nskipped.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b8300bfe93ce654382b594d1ce75d65b486f452","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/5b8300bfe93ce654382b594d1ce75d65b486f452"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/d64e656233f275bb67232a0adb5cc2334ca019b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b8300bfe93ce654382b594d1ce75d65b486f452\nparent 3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784381055 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784381055 -0400\n\nperf(bff): parallelize teardown resource listing and deletion (#73)\n\nFan out all resource-kind listings via Promise.allSettled (read-only,\nsafe to run concurrently), then delete matching resources within each\nkind in parallel (independent operations). Error accumulation pattern\nis preserved: list failures and per-resource delete failures are\ncollected and returned in the errors array; 404s are still silently\nskipped.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW35/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi2gQAFBflBCbY35c1SS7ppUUmqqq\nwNgS9POuJJXcDy7NMwU+63YuYOG6YEknPVq4ymxmZ45jzoxF0Ekc1cPUGBsU9pu+\n3zi0+dNew6JlTJmroa3wGSn8+Hmcy5m/dolRTyj0ObZ1WiMl9QL8IKxUXKvx2PiK\njoigea9xngnUEehCARcvnyYjzlnSjZq4MxhfYwXJgQ7RP9cDCrU79XkhR0rl+pmm\nU/Vdbgd1cYNsXA5n2ZT7phyr2hcfekAa76gN1YXvGzHYS13dcWvqFSR9V+aZ2HCL\nbjyqIw4X6huag8Zbaib1z6SR7Wr5zuJY2Uc/dH2tn2Rqwl4y1SF4S6GeUBZdaBlo\n+Sg7u7rAVgcQSs+zSC2aE4jnPCzgv6jbphKrycDqtfKdrxFs7MZiRv/EoT5pJI4S\n7vBXtfwBv6UssKa8u9aBK3yQ0d2tL5O6hl8hWEzvZn+rvih/x41bfwrhzGLFi0oR\nhnT6tVgJKivxpk/tnq0E5DZ0xSubo7ZOlAWSQ1YQtMEbB/oz6I9XnIUg4Kadj7Td\nAeyXwmJmVI2xhLDqQASB087qvgGuAoFybvbV097muddS/dUgb2xm1d4nDIiVjhii\nG4NJuF4587kUc1iVGdX7gb2AiYzkHuvt2gJBl/Iv529CCQf0Nu7aL/YDRNMoEIr9\nQvxU3aAtW6w/9YKn+vWo\n=ZzGY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T13:24:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/d64e656233f275bb67232a0adb5cc2334ca019b1","node_id":"C_kwDOTbpVO9oAKGQ2NGU2NTYyMzNmMjc1YmI2NzIzMmEwYWRiNWNjMjMzNGNhMDE5YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f","sha":"3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f"}],"sha":"d64e656233f275bb67232a0adb5cc2334ca019b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/d64e656233f275bb67232a0adb5cc2334ca019b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:19:38Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:19:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): align teardown label selector with Helm-rendered labels (#72)\n\nUse both app.kubernetes.io/part-of=superset and\napp.kubernetes.io/instance=<releaseName> as the label selector for\nteardown resource listing. This matches the labels actually set by the\nhelmRenderer''s superset.labels helpers, avoiding false matches against\nother workloads that might share the part-of=superset label alone.\n\nAdds TEARDOWN_LABEL_SELECTOR constant to resourceNames.ts and documents\nthe selector choice inline in the teardown route handler. Updates\nsupersetDeploy.test.ts to assert the combined selector is passed to\nlistResources.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ff55d1d1c53e99e3411d36d9e9cb0a473c2d26f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/9ff55d1d1c53e99e3411d36d9e9cb0a473c2d26f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ff55d1d1c53e99e3411d36d9e9cb0a473c2d26f\nparent 7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784380778 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784380778 -0400\n\nfix(bff): align teardown label selector with Helm-rendered labels (#72)\n\nUse both app.kubernetes.io/part-of=superset and\napp.kubernetes.io/instance=<releaseName> as the label selector for\nteardown resource listing. This matches the labels actually set by the\nhelmRenderer''s superset.labels helpers, avoiding false matches against\nother workloads that might share the part-of=superset label alone.\n\nAdds TEARDOWN_LABEL_SELECTOR constant to resourceNames.ts and documents\nthe selector choice inline in the teardown route handler. Updates\nsupersetDeploy.test.ts to assert the combined selector is passed to\nlistResources.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW31qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+ywQACSWFMRzxlfKkBVTpCIYIfSx\ncPut4NPw83wUUT1Yvs94Q9+xZxh5EchFhMUm3zFAIYdEoiClatS/PsNWPWecuzyN\nn+Ehr94+Q4M87zyG5to7naayufS+z4KffBuRUTT01VLquIllyHxeMA6rE5jiYfQe\nhsjEMtu1AtAYF8d2TzctZk1iCuW2foUEikogqhQSWAM57jUFH9sH7J74tMS8Im0O\nvFRBX/b9Zq78pViY632uO5BgdxqxCQgxi2EhIsFokH1e3Aer/2qAe8UCjNx+cqos\nkpgdXykyLttC+ONE+TEmF5/63sf98CkSWVcvmSd5A2bUSkdcDNyRlDTg/mn7zHe1\npYPNiDPZqtnFPH5d3Tz4zsv0kF2n/c0FuE1RMUh9h4BKqYGpU+AiVm4I4KYDFabr\nlEvWjAFal0L4tdgr5LzPIdC69qq1eFyhCxvqC6wBshx5iu1/zC9opbOcsEjjuAJi\n2oYF5scyBZBSdSY5uona+v1jxy7LGjL6f+kaMxtaQR8UKY8If0TdpFpHdUrlCLkW\nEA9Lr3L5dGq/S8OlaO1vTkrNWEuMUyjAVo/IRep/+AEO/HSUdSTUT1LGgj9LN0BW\nKXxNw3ndWBemW3AvXJeOgGkxGuf1/bHnFw9IYfxfFEvU809W3gM9xFqakkm5bxmN\nVSs/LRWQLIIDFtwcnTVo\n=RaTR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T13:19:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f","node_id":"C_kwDOTbpVO9oAKDNlOTdmZmNiMzE3ZjliYWQzNGI0MTVhZmUyNTFjNDVmOTFlODdlM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1","sha":"7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1"}],"sha":"3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/3e97ffcb317f9bad34b415afe251c45f91e87e3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:14:26Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:14:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): add SupersetClient.forHealthCheck factory for unauthenticated health checks (#71)\n\nThe status route was calling `new SupersetClient(serviceUrl, '''', '''')` for\nthe Superset `/health` endpoint (which requires no credentials), leaving\nreaders to wonder whether the empty strings were intentional or a bug.\n\nAdd `SupersetClient.forHealthCheck(baseUrl, options?)` — a static factory\nthat creates a credential-free client and documents explicitly that only\nunauthenticated operations (getSupersetHealth) should be called on it.\nUpdate the status route to use the factory and add unit tests covering the\nnew method.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"066846a0566bd8d0b2abb63493abb8c2f02dd9fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/066846a0566bd8d0b2abb63493abb8c2f02dd9fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/7f7b73037486606f0df8a828ac121d7f4d9f5ff1","verification":{"payload":"tree 066846a0566bd8d0b2abb63493abb8c2f02dd9fb\nparent 8fb3d011ab5831b981d70bac8b69d049ce9afdcb\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784380466 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784380466 -0400\n\nfix(bff): add SupersetClient.forHealthCheck factory for unauthenticated health checks (#71)\n\nThe status route was calling `new SupersetClient(serviceUrl, '''', '''')` for\nthe Superset `/health` endpoint (which requires no credentials), leaving\nreaders to wonder whether the empty strings were intentional or a bug.\n\nAdd `SupersetClient.forHealthCheck(baseUrl, options?)` — a static factory\nthat creates a credential-free client and documents explicitly that only\nunauthenticated operations (getSupersetHealth) should be called on it.\nUpdate the status route to use the factory and add unit tests covering the\nnew method.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW3wyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr2sQABWiS6x0ftFs/d/jWbCzjlSQ\nUbQNUV7FW/yYnWEXFpbQinh63lbzsBAC9L0LDmtLm8OiQfaGO7u4VEKc8RRchzTq\nt50uathTOgdU05x0m7jwdxBZsawq+cP+2OAoBt9K2PzvrhVWRcvU+Y2QoxG2twjX\n0aVexdSY3pvLtJirTlvhUkWydCBIoXMGnhWtvgGA9C2lWOXdFHOK/XHW1nosvfUG\n1o1bQeVO8e2aSMLkcoCU2JoulPZvRGMHsz9iT5ASD+OL6Qq43pTu7im3v3vR8wAD\nQgjRQ3tsm2JWmBMMKiu3UlfMGCSdo+n8xitcVAJXeWRbrmorWfKf6OrAXnwBYv/X\ndbYX/Aat+76dhDOsMUnnW76qCwQLsZhbVPGgbDMwiWP/DwrgPyYYNvr+PZR1nlvJ\niNoACdhVin0/XCx94T1wKLiINnscQ2S595u5GvID+0X+SL/BshF5lvdrDYoW7yWO\naaFFTT7gXpI+9D/e2uUvR1B5K4QROtS6G0HHHN+px4rFvM5Tvy7dbDZFr3Htb7jm\nmvsbdzMdDW2NQis+fJ25aKbW5t3I/TWQfyx3FQ81ZjkFB7udCcMC+FT4usushTys\nQQPR1dYfzXZgFVa8xlTNsdQuwRNM7TWebkBeCVgleUz8UskfLdwp0GFLsvXpxCDV\nCrmTq5XZn9SDznfI6wFi\n=rECL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T13:14:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http