er"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T13:12:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): validate port range in CORS origin validation (#70)\n\nAdd a capturing group for the port in ORIGIN_REGEX and perform a\npost-match numeric range check to reject ports outside 1–65535.\nCovers invalid values like 0, 65536, and 99999 that the regex alone\ncould not reject.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a2bff0fd7636ab8466688f452a87c443b9f35c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/2a2bff0fd7636ab8466688f452a87c443b9f35c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/8fb3d011ab5831b981d70bac8b69d049ce9afdcb","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a2bff0fd7636ab8466688f452a87c443b9f35c0\nparent 41c424ebaa4911898a37194b3e017bcf051496b9\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784380330 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784380330 -0400\n\nfix(bff): validate port range in CORS origin validation (#70)\n\nAdd a capturing group for the port in ORIGIN_REGEX and perform a\npost-match numeric range check to reject ports outside 1–65535.\nCovers invalid values like 0, 65536, and 99999 that the regex alone\ncould not reject.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW3uqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyEcQADFq0HwlHBwFXs5glNNPrzk4\nwnx4NtO4kzkl3PsbK5+E57SWMBofPHVHWlkEgKS7NvjBxvzsoB9qcIqTibvOClRK\n1hna+V+dF9H+U8gB//z5cT9lPFFIXAzEKzVl7FL5bUkRVN4bfIKty836H4ZTFswT\nOn2V+/j0p51KcefmunZ2vL8gCgH2bhGshHOlxrk4VwH7b4q2NiiHj5njmL4M3zep\nl1oAkNuzrA3qlmvDYuc6bYLVh6a6nEtu2SXARO+ad0LABnHuNZclB6GDLmpXA377\n8g1eGnS+mzc9Bwz3XSRwPt6oy804pLmhtP5cJyaFDCN+wEyxH0WmgTuH3Gwp3dWp\na/yk/3yc73HMJ33AyQcWRU8+cg