guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/9086b99fd9727af59141cd4419f6c417810d7c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:09:23Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:09:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): surface warnings for unparseable YAML and unresolved directives in helmRenderer (#50)\n\nReplace the silent catch block around yaml.load() with a warning that\ncaptures the parse error message. Detect unresolved template directives\nbefore the catch-all regex strips them, and emit a warning per unique\ndirective. Change the return type of renderHelmTemplates from K8sResource[]\nto HelmRenderResult { resources, warnings } so callers can observe\nincomplete rendering. Add tests verifying warnings for bad YAML documents,\nunresolved directives, and the clean-render no-warning case.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b84f4389fc03519a4641a3ce6d465a37fb3e5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/1b84f4389fc03519a4641a3ce6d465a37fb3e5d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/9086b99fd9727af59141cd4419f6c417810d7c62","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b84f4389fc03519a4641a3ce6d465a37fb3e5d4\nparent f348ba9bb102e0a71f3262544ddb906cff04cf00\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784326163 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784326163 -0400\n\nfix(bff): surface warnings for unparseable YAML and unresolved directives in helmRenderer (#50)\n\nReplace the silent catch block around yaml.load() with a warning that\ncaptures the parse error message. Detect unresolved template directives\nbefore the catch-all regex strips them, and emit a warning per unique\ndirective. Change the return type of renderHelmTemplates from K8sResource[]\nto HelmRenderResult { resources, warnings } so callers can observe\nincomplete rendering. Add tests verifying warnings for bad YAML documents,\nunresolved directives, and the clean-render no-warning case.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWqgTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADWwQAFN6KfQyoZbpG7XesRv/yCp5\nCC23djiezUq+ZtWP25s5ZLfmNbfPlpEyCy5OCiad+dK7gG6ljRfmPSC8NrTMK814\n3Cssla7Iw5pmbwc+uhu85ZpdNh4r84QBU84sF7OoK9XLOErMJvcKwJGIN/Wa+wfH\n7X4T5YNxbWxI+ZyPGlwZwdhaOBUPQKrLEDoEcCDid0w8y/YftLV8sSDcm4CDOHjP\nQPhvVBpSpJcSNGprnvSsQQasPpHyotkkXuHrN4wFhgTMEJ7w246foPS8N639ejMN\njb5A6SDHp4eBNLBQgHcvK2hOu8w8lDzD9J+N0HvPRvjjc+S+7ezcZFLN2+mp4RE+\nmQCQlFGXM+bApZOfW4l5hvxdQVvofiIZgst5LHCV5uNFkISQf3z90vc4xUqINfOe\nodQ7czgIknZcs26UPdrgVb9RGcQx+A+0lbcfQA2bk5PsOrkGaDrLGQzo/apUw//l\nLRbH/zs9K2HZNzqB4nlC0xJKSOWt3hLnecFUeW8ZRZKrhipNNgcpBJK+i3agaAyd\nKR8Oq9i1kro9pySPOXV1JN24mzY/mHNmiCN7w80W+/pW9UkU32RLwy2BxpdgOUOG\no1didbCHnz4jjgBjvuKnr9rdY1NlrsZiUbOvXulZ7XzC1wOCfmhMDFLb8AQDV7oO\n4o16ewKXzcqJzRToKnRt\n=Hees\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T22:09:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gis