"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/f348ba9bb102e0a71f3262544ddb906cff04cf00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:01:37Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:01:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(bff): prevent concurrent login requests in SupersetClient (#49)\n\nIntroduce a pending-promise pattern in getAccessToken(): store the\nin-flight doLogin() promise in a loginPromise field so concurrent\ncallers share it rather than each triggering a separate login HTTP\nrequest. The .finally() clears loginPromise after completion so a\nsubsequent call after a failure will retry correctly.\n\nExtracts the login HTTP call into a private doLogin() helper and adds a\ntest asserting that three concurrent getAccessToken() calls only produce\na single HTTP request.\n\nFixes #36\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2aa4189a3c67d5432d01e66e332ff6ae6aa1f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/a2aa4189a3c67d5432d01e66e332ff6ae6aa1f50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/f348ba9bb102e0a71f3262544ddb906cff04cf00","verification":{"payload":"tree a2aa4189a3c67d5432d01e66e332ff6ae6aa1f50\nparent b7d60073c7d51956905c61bff5bfd80bf34534f9\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784325697 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784325697 -0400\n\nfix(bff): prevent concurrent login requests in SupersetClient (#49)\n\nIntroduce a pending-promise pattern in getAccessToken(): store the\nin-flight doLogin() promise in a loginPromise field so concurrent\ncallers share it rather than each triggering a separate login HTTP\nrequest. The .finally() clears loginPromise after completion so a\nsubsequent call after a failure will retry correctly.\n\nExtracts the login HTTP call into a private doLogin() helper and adds a\ntest asserting that three concurrent getAccessToken() calls only produce\na single HTTP request.\n\nFixes #36\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWqZBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6nMQAFW3Ldq/5QMGOfEIYsuIzl0S\n5aJ7R/ENOwWajzMYEFZgNPqcMlo/Pnm9GkrsyO0Vcz98mjVK1qFAmmj3AJ4zaZTP\nqTnxGi9vtruE582EHigbQCmGLGK9Y5GntSMXG8bIZE3z0LTfY1qJ7Fxdxsjnqm3v\nfHPfLMCjuroR3MAmSw7kBMPLBX/URQoyCJHaRyAIxIGjBKFno7qdvtIRs3FsDFvj\n45dCxns/upXNvWX12kUH0TWgUKEnYtqqSjQNq+xvmPSBWg0ZjCRND9xMzR1SJK1w\nJCti53KMwT7lo/egXN0JtGNOwZX2MQ3+RtvoRpaHEoNjE7BwHxaJ2t27o3tkzhCI\nf11eWY1NIBbiVlCc0Ss6OAGTzGVdTV9lkUZeKy3pX5YY7u45+K39HsLjQb+4nmEt\nuNEseH4R609z5bDBx3xFYoAz5lX1oFAneeGs3Sqt4i2TfDn0jOpvCnDh7mljfF8Q\nOY5jjTcjLbIGgMtvZPk7tzKHAm1LOBxe2kyzkbr1mnkmAa6i8laoOp0+GdllYgJK\nmflgAeqr0Dgbn1aRopwsjX0lFFVxV2zTG9hr7B8KKAaMMlmUIW+XOTjxcGQCSr4Y\nrEj1PBuG+G5s4ObP6S254rmp9JtLfww0FfYFs/MVTRpSTkL8OAw/dDuWLnMIH8Ff\na7/ITFKAQfqaVF7y9rsI\n=lTQO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T22:01:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlc