source (#46)\n\nReplace the naive `kind.toLowerCase() + ''s''` fallback with an explicit\nerror so that new K8s kinds must be added to KIND_RESOURCE_MAP. This\nprevents silent generation of invalid API paths (e.g. Ingress → ingresss,\nEndpoints → endpointss). Adds a test that asserts the error is thrown for\nan unmapped kind.\n\nCloses #35\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWqY1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9nIQAGNybHmVXouLRwK8Tp512haf\nf94KnWhsL474zIwSjJoLLOlYJAEvBXyicz+8Fg2kZUsSnctlAUbProrSKhhP1gNn\nO21ZdPWzLqYLLOeU9Na2hU71WUeSkc0qJcQ7psHeAa9PnW5Q6DrcgMF7bT5vLby5\nSSuaJVKbZ26Ofln0mlZpJivVeAUd9sZK2x5T6Nr1G5jnIdkDpFb6YOW5+VNRFqN6\nAjEaEdUClrWZK4TUvVrsfBY1F253UuxSKtHvp0/38derlrXkRJ9/EHgJm5pfpQFC\nvQF3sKu3WTw/J1EG2KefHz2wp1xWPc2vmeRnpVUJDFccIuWup7zHJShY/AR1RD8z\n7tVjJJKh0KaL43A4W+UFAUc4zFZ2TqfPPDYY4EsAYYLxTXXBVxF/wb3ALeBAwNoa\nXFo87CuaOL0bPtD3epdYQwXiXbhqSkK7J36bV6Lq08fjZ6g0ygZbKKcy3pQlCrdC\n2bU9U9QEP8JACG5c4QcPosHfhaNYCCbU4r57+Tbwe1Qd8pq3neV4gpqeTKDMwOvD\nInePfDxIH2Tlaxc+MK/J3xZdCh2E/3p1OuWhe3cwyzDJSN51vUBhDkPGhOc0Xw0I\n/5AH3A7kMyd4p5nBtYzOqJHmar4Ac+yi/vXpDAOxVUKIFkFgn38xVFO/aN7iYPNa\nP2UB498/CGZ4aOJzU7i6\n=RN43\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-17T22:01:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_event