 Remove the dead os.environ.get\ncall and use the hostname directly; drop the now-unused `os` import.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f3c44e514c7a1baa58fc97c15d6b5bf2fd39e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/6f3c44e514c7a1baa58fc97c15d6b5bf2fd39e55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/02e548cf93c314ecda4cff4c6f71f9168dae8935","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f3c44e514c7a1baa58fc97c15d6b5bf2fd39e55\nparent e57b6f57806577b7f5a44dc6e255ff4b1f3de3ac\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784318267 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784318267 -0400\n\nfix(chart): remove dead PGHOST env var lookup in wait-for-postgres (#31)\n\nThe initContainer had no env/envFrom block, so os.environ.get(''PGHOST'', ...)\nalways fell through to the Helm-rendered default. Remove the dead os.environ.get\ncall and use the hostname directly; drop the now-unused `os` import.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWok7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvbIQADk854F9YJSp/fX4GdrzDr81\nLNbRi0H9w8MfcNh7Ub5dTYyLHv6zIioD7Lv9ZTWsFDMnfRlrZ9S3ZDPsk7+/S3gb\nxf0BEWDFOXqHqbmNO6mFB/mOdKTL+K9VdKsh8nT+n/B2ewfbexgXbvUzAszRCGhe\nDxGK496ncE9AHh5CH9mdD4v9s0OenstZSl+KtMiCKegzYwETHp4evA5wd06fxj7c\n+wSATZppbRb2vpQSWWZp6JdC/axXFLmUaDmyawg0emiNb5RqysiAe+FQhvOOPx8x\nZ0dXPGf7WkIvVV+Y+8IJ3ODOByHD8RZpX2DZRJM3PJ5YW6CQ+TH4iA3udb/rSjiZ\n1/nwJV63TfpNbX7ID/EGE7gL3cDV68F7IsCMfZioczeCS4wkc9va6KmICZ9RdCF3\nyR4TwpJKN4vszg3+092WYnluW7vCDZkeIzMGCvczrtsVFA/iJdunPNf3eakkRN9U\nu2uPoRZhOLCkFhQZWG43uruMuxgC+w6kfAZP1AajNruHvENVbYs7kTXAyY+OkE6U\nQypEJ21nqSKeQs+q/0KYX00V4U7Q59O1xQjW1OGLftAPYDE/gwILMNpqhpqXzAqg\nusFjMRYr19Pi67Zw8p61PxC0ycNJ4XAhS4WkU6EIic