4b1f3de3ac","node_id":"C_kwDOTbpVO9oAKGU1N2I2ZjU3ODA2NTc3YjdmNWE0NGRjNmUyNTVmZjRiMWYzZGUzYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2","sha":"0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2"}],"sha":"e57b6f57806577b7f5a44dc6e255ff4b1f3de3ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/e57b6f57806577b7f5a44dc6e255ff4b1f3de3ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:52:41Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:52:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(chart): reduce fullname truncation to prevent name collisions (#29)\n\nWhen Release.Name >= ~42 chars, superset.fullname produced a 50-char\nstring; appending \"-postgres\" (9 chars) then truncating at 50 stripped\nthe discriminator entirely, making superset.postgres.fullname identical\nto superset.fullname. Both Deployments got the same name.\n\nReduce trunc in superset.fullname from 50 → 41. This guarantees\n41 + 9 (\"-postgres\") = 50, so the postgres discriminator is always\npreserved. The longest derived name (\"{41}-postgres-svc\" = 54 chars)\nstays well within the Kubernetes 63-char limit.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fbd1253be92da3ba019854c6170b82002d7926d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/7fbd1253be92da3ba019854c6170b82002d7926d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2","verification":{"payload":"tree 7fbd1253be92da3ba019854c6170b82002d7926d\nparent 437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784317961 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784317961 -0400\n\nfix(chart): reduce fullname truncation to prevent name collisions (#29)\n\nWhen Release.Name >= ~42 chars, superset.fullname produced a 50-char\nstring; appending \"-postgres\" (9 chars) then truncating at 50 stripped\nthe discriminator entirely, making superset.postgres.fullname identical\nto superset.fullname. Both Deployments got the same name.\n\nReduce trunc in superset.fullname from 50 → 41. This guarantees\n41 + 9 (\"-postgres\") = 50, so the postgres discriminator is always\npreserved. The longest derived name (\"{41}-postgres-svc\" = 54 chars)\nstays well within the Kubernetes 63-char limit.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq