ps://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commit/437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420","sha":"437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420"}],"sha":"0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/0b6d0ffbf61e9196feec27b2c8f1a5b2662c26e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:47:35Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:47:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(chart): validate postgres password is alphanumeric (#27)\n\n* fix(chart): validate postgres password is alphanumeric\n\nAdd a regexMatch assertion in superset-secret.yaml that fails helm\ninstall/upgrade when postgres.password contains URI-special characters\n(@, :, /, %, #). The password is interpolated directly into the\nSQLAlchemy connection URI without URL-encoding, so non-alphanumeric\ncharacters produce a malformed URI and prevent Superset from connecting.\n\nDocument the alphanumeric constraint in values.yaml comments.\n\nCloses #13\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a163ff3415c4442b6942ec8f4f9f7ff98a2520ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/a163ff3415c4442b6942ec8f4f9f7ff98a2520ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/437b3c5b05084ba8f075e2ee497473ad5291e420","verification":{"payload":"tree a163ff3415c4442b6942ec8f4f9f7ff98a2520ef\nparent 5f0cbfbf7ea9331a0007e99b4ce61edbc225107a\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784317655 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784317655 -0400\n\nfix(chart): validate postgres password is alphanumeric (#27)\n\n* fix(chart): validate postgres password is alphanumeric\n\nAdd a regexMatch assertion in superset-secret.yaml that fails helm\ninstall/upgrade when postgres.password contains URI-special characters\n(@, :, /, %, #). The password is interpolated directly into the\nSQLAlchemy connection URI without URL-encoding, so non-alphanumeric\ncharacters produce a malformed URI and prevent Superset from connecting.\n\nDocument the alphanumeric constraint in values.yaml comments.\n\nCloses #13\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR