,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:46:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(chart): handle create-admin errors selectively (#28)\n\nReplace the blanket `|| true` on `superset fab create-admin` with a\npattern that captures both stdout and stderr, then re-raises the exit\ncode for any failure that is not the known-idempotent \"already exists\"\ncase. Silent swallowing of DB errors, missing env vars, or transient\nnetwork failures is now prevented.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fed3c5a2b75bffdacf43418b0945c850712f5c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/6fed3c5a2b75bffdacf43418b0945c850712f5c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/5f0cbfbf7ea9331a0007e99b4ce61edbc225107a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6fed3c5a2b75bffdacf43418b0945c850712f5c6\nparent e8a0899bda7e1bc5705d693541814a682b5b7bfb\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784317564 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784317564 -0400\n\nfix(chart): handle create-admin errors selectively (#28)\n\nReplace the blanket `|| true` on `superset fab create-admin` with a\npattern that captures both stdout and stderr, then re-raises the exit\ncode for any failure that is not the known-idempotent \"already exists\"\ncase. Silent swallowing of DB errors, missing env vars, or transient\nnetwork failures is now prevented.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWoZ8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACDgQACDYTNfSas2u9pURONuIxFh4\nHpCEzXMX+3+poot9fYIvtY+mNDT6NTBy/SVtwkRu0wL0rapkiUeufz1b/vfykpW3\nls8i+9XCZ82ysFBANYUh/nBbT+X9TBmZzuggrQHgogPPKMyVsJCpx/Y5c/WH3qMC\nPiKhK/viuMVgD9Wse7wNlEUC5L4obxdZJz+R