 fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8f7857e058e18ee704cce676cbc89d3f33bb107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/d8f7857e058e18ee704cce676cbc89d3f33bb107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/e8a0899bda7e1bc5705d693541814a682b5b7bfb","verification":{"payload":"tree d8f7857e058e18ee704cce676cbc89d3f33bb107\nparent d0bf6d0f03d6eaf32e82dc910d1ad19fbd4b4e98\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 1784317189 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784317189 -0400\n\nfix(chart): coerce port value to int in configmap template (#25)\n\n* fix(chart): coerce port value to int in configmap template\n\nPipe .Values.port through Helm''s int filter so non-numeric input\n(e.g. injected strings) causes a render-time panic rather than\nproducing valid multi-statement Python that could execute at startup.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWoUFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUQcQAIpNCiGtQeV4UMd3TErb0l3O\nJG/zCBiPk0TfgmnCwQZZbfBiRjHhrvVzxFk86stLd6uWe/V24S2BNqojj+4kS69u\nD9TNM+ZvtDrel4KIcC35fYqcOGxkQyXpPdmuk4bP7ILsTE0lNDGzzeTSaaZmgTfd\nuL1ig6/JYcHyHv5FVd7waeYFPS45S6P0kJM1r6HJo8sRHZDRf/6HJ0DBNHX6+6YA\nNC1JWHVETHS4/ZTcH/HlWgMT4ZrazbaDw0lp5YxR4DZ