":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/commits/238e1e480ee11d3413d42eebe271692c3942badd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:31:56Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:31:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Phase 2 — nonroot Superset container image and build tooling (#10)\n\n* feat: remove seed content and establish Superset plugin routing\n\nStrip all seed/demo pages (UserInfo, ClusterResources, NamespaceSummary),\nseed-only hooks (useK8sResources, useNamespaceSummary), and BFF\nnamespaceSummary route. Replace with two-page navigation structure:\nInstance Management and Embedded Dashboards.\n\nPhase 1 of the Apache Superset RHOAI Dashboard plugin project plan.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update DASHBOARD_APIS.md cross-references to deleted seed pages (#6)\n\nReplace four relative links pointing to removed seed pages\n(UserInfoPage.tsx, ClusterResourcesPage.tsx, NamespaceSummaryPage.tsx)\nwith inline references to the relevant sections and code examples\nalready present in the document.\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update PROJECT_LAYOUT.md to reflect current file structure (#7)\n\nReplace removed seed pages (UserInfoPage, ClusterResourcesPage,\nNamespaceSummaryPage) with the new Superset pages\n(InstanceManagementPage, EmbeddedDashboardsPage). Remove deleted hooks\n(useK8sResources, useNamespaceSummary) and add the missing\nuseLastSelectedProject hook. Update bff/src/types.ts annotation from\nPodCounts/NamespaceInfo to K8sResource/K8sList.\n\nCloses #3\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update CLAUDE.md to reflect current hooks after seed removal (#8)\n\n* fix(docs): update CLAUDE.md to reflect current hooks after seed removal\n\nAdd the missing useLastSelectedProject hook to the seed hooks list in\nAGENTS.md (which CLAUDE.md symlinks to) so AI agents have an accurate\npicture of which hooks exist in the codebase.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nRemove useK8sResources and useNamespaceSummary from the list of retained\nseed-project hooks in AGENTS.md, keeping only the five hooks that are\nintended to remain: useCurrentUser, useProjects, useFavoriteProjects,\nuseAccessReview, and useLastSelectedProject.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update BFF_PATTERN.md to reflect current BFF structure (#9)\n\n* fix(docs): update BFF_PATTERN.md to reflect current BFF structure\n\nReplace all references to the seed project''s namespaceSummary route,\nPodCounts/NamespaceInfo types, and namespaceSummary.test.ts with\nSuperset-specific placeholders that match the planned BFF endpoints\ndocumented in SUPERSET_PLUGIN_ARCHITECTURE.md.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nCorrect two inaccurate directory tree annotations in BFF_PATTERN.md:\n- server.ts: remove reference to non-existent Superset routes\n- types.ts: replace placeholder Superset types with actual K8s types\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add nonroot Superset container image and build tooling (Phase 2)\n\nAdd Containerfile.superset based on apache/superset:4.1.1 with group\npermissions adjusted for OpenShift restricted SCC (USER 1001:0).\n\nUpdate Makefile, build-push.sh, scan-image.sh, CI workflow, and docs\nto support the new `superset` target alongside frontend and BFF.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update stale namespace-summary references in DASHBOARD_APIS.md (#12)\n\n---\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f36379269c76b2f68a97c0bd6307718934d8b726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/trees/f36379269c76b2f68a97c0bd6307718934d8b726"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/apache-superset/git/commits/238e1e480ee11d3413d42eebe271692c3942badd","verification":{"payload":"tree f36379269c76b2f68a97c0bd6307718934d8b726\nparent bede2a470d2d8995b7e39098d08c741c59429326\nparent af81e169bc736b150b171d2328a07b3a1d66bee4\nauthor Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com> 178430