icture of which hooks exist in the codebase.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nRemove useK8sResources and useNamespaceSummary from the list of retained\nseed-project hooks in AGENTS.md, keeping only the five hooks that are\nintended to remain: useCurrentUser, useProjects, useFavoriteProjects,\nuseAccessReview, and useLastSelectedProject.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docs): update BFF_PATTERN.md to reflect current BFF structure (#9)\n\n* fix(docs): update BFF_PATTERN.md to reflect current BFF structure\n\nReplace all references to the seed project''s namespaceSummary route,\nPodCounts/NamespaceInfo types, and namespaceSummary.test.ts with\nSuperset-specific placeholders that match the planned BFF endpoints\ndocumented in SUPERSET_PLUGIN_ARCHITECTURE.md.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review findings (round 1)\n\nCorrect two inaccurate directory tree annotations in BFF_PATTERN.md:\n- server.ts: remove reference to non-existent Superset routes\n- types.ts: replace placeholder Superset types with actual K8s types\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add nonroot Superset container image and build tooling (Phase 2)\n\nAdd Containerfile.superset based on apache/superset:4.1.1 with group\npermissions adjusted for OpenShift restricted SCC (USER 1001:0).\n\nUpdate Makefile, b